nDescription":"A fresh onion","redCabbageDescription":"A head of red cabbage","roastDinner":"Roast Dinner","roastDinnerDescription":"A hearty roast dinner with all the trimmings","salad":"Salad","saladDescription":"A healthy fresh salad","stuffedPepper":"Stuffed Pepper","stuffedPepperDescription":"A pepper stuffed with a savoury filling","sushi":"Sushi","sushiDescription":"Freshly rolled sushi","tomatoDescription":"A ripe tomato","vegetableSoup":"Vegetable Soup","vegetableSoupDescription":"A warm bowl of vegetable soup","woodTrophy":"Wood Trophy","stoneTrophy":"Stone Trophy","ironTrophy":"Iron Trophy","diamondTrophy":"Diamond Trophy","moonstoneTrophy":"Moonstone Trophy","directionalArrow":"{{colour}} Directional Arrow","landingPad":"Landing Pad","landingPadDescription":"Negates fall damage when landed on","weakJumpPad":"Weak Jump Pad","jumpPad":"Jump Pad","strongJumpPad":"Strong Jump Pad","superJumpPad":"Super Jump Pad","jumpPadDescription":"Launches the player upwards","gunLuckyBlock":"Gun Lucky Block","petLuckyBlock":"Pet Lucky Block","overgrownGrassBlock":"Overgrown Grass Block","overgrownPineGrassBlock":"Overgrown Pine Grass Block","overgrownJungleGrassBlock":"Overgrown Jungle Grass Block","fragGrenade":"Frag Grenade","fragGrenadeDescription":"Throw to deal explosive damage.","miningGrenade":"Mining Grenade","miningGrenadeDescription":"Throw to blast a hole through terrain.","smokeGrenade":"Smoke Grenade","smokeGrenadeDescription":"Throw to create a smokescreen.","Pipe":"Pipe","PipeDescription":"Carries items between machines and chests. Use Extractor Pipes to pull from chests.","autoMiner":"Auto Miner","autoMinerDescription":"Burns coal to mine ores from bedrock below. Right-click to deposit coal. Ores output through a pipe connected to the top of the miner.","autoCrafter":"Auto Crafter","autoCrafterDescription":"Crafts one item per second from deposited ingredients. Right-click to deposit, or pipe ingredients in from any side. Crafted items prefer a pipe on top so they don\'t loop back into an input pipe; otherwise any connected pipe is used.","rocketShip":"Stage 1 Rocket Ship","rocketShipS2":"Stage 2 Rocket Ship (Engine)","rocketShipS3":"Stage 3 Rocket Ship (Hull)","rocketShipS4":"Stage 4 Rocket Ship (Cockpit)","rocketShipS5":"Stage 5 (Complete) Rocket Ship (Nose Cone)","rocketShipDescription":"Use it to go to the moon! A towering rocket ship built in stages. Place it and right-click to upgrade.","pipe":"Pipe","pipeDescription":"Carries items between machines and chests. Use Extractor Pipes to pull from chests.","extractorPipe":"Extractor Pipe","extractorPipeDescription":"Place next to a chest to pull items into connected pipes.","splitterPipe":"Splitter Pipe","splitterPipeDescription":"Hub that splits incoming items evenly across all other connected pipes or chests.","filterPipe":"Filter Pipe","filterPipeDescription":"Hub with one input arm and five colour-coded output arms. Right-click to set which item leaves each output.","solarPanel":"Solar Panel","solarPanelDescription":"A 2x2 photovoltaic array. Connect wires to its sides to power machines.","wire":"Wire","wireDescription":"Connects Solar Panels to Auto Miners to carry power.","mergerPipe":"Merger Pipe","mergerPipeDescription":"Hub that funnels items from any arm out a single output arm. Right-click to set the output direction.","autoHarvester":"Auto Harvester","autoHarvesterDescription":"Automatically harvests grown crops within a 2-block radius and replants them. Burns coal, or connect a Solar Panel with wire to run for free. Right-click to deposit coal. Crops output through a connected pipe.","lunite":"Lunite","luniteOre":"Lunite Ore","blockOfLunite":"Block of Lunite","luniteOreDescription":"Found on the moon. Launch a rocket to go to the moon.","luniteAutoMiner":"Lunite Auto Miner","luniteAutoMinerDescription":"An upgraded Auto Miner that produces ores faster. Burns coal or runs on solar power. Right-click to configure fuel and ore output.","luniteAutoCrafter":"Lunite Auto Crafter","luniteAutoCrafterDescription":"An upgraded Auto Crafter that crafts faster and has a 20% chance to produce a bonus copy of each craft (except block compression recipes).","luniteAutoHarvester":"Lunite Auto Harvester","luniteAutoHarvesterDescription":"An upgraded Auto Harvester with a 25% chance to duplicate each crop drop it harvests. Burns coal or runs on solar power.","luniteDescription":"Found on the moon. Launch a rocket to go to the moon.","blockOfLuniteDescription":"Decorative. Obtained using Moonstone Pickaxe.","bowlingAlleyFloor":"Bowling Alley Floor","redKart":"Red Kart","stalkerSpawnOrb":"Stalker Spawn Orb","stalkerSpawnOrbDescription":"Throw to spawn a Stalker at the landing location","stalkerMobSpawnerBlock":"Stalker Spawner Block","stalkerMobSpawnerBlockDescription":"Place to automatically spawn Stalkers","hovercraft":"Hovercraft","woodClock":"Wood Clock","goldClock":"Gold Clock","clockDescription":"Shows the time of day.","flashlight":"Flashlight","flashlightDescription":"Shines a bright beam where you\'re looking. Long range.","miningHelmet":"Mining Helmet","miningHelmetDescription":"Lights up the way you\'re looking. Medium range.","goldCrop":"Gold Crop","goldCropDescription":"A shimmering, valuable crop. Sell it to Gill at the Farmer\'s Guild.","croneSpawnOrb":"Crone Spawn Orb","croneSpawnOrbDescription":"Throw to spawn a Crone at the landing location","croneMobSpawnerBlock":"Crone Spawner Block","croneMobSpawnerBlockDescription":"Place to automatically spawn Crones","offRoader":"Off Roader","speedboat":"Speedboat","militaryHelmet":"Military Helmet","militaryChestplate":"Military Chestplate","militaryGauntlets":"Military Gauntlets","militaryLeggings":"Military Leggings","militaryBoots":"Military Boots","medkit":"Medkit","slimeSpawnOrb":"Slime Spawn Orb","slimeSpawnOrbDescription":"Throw to spawn a Slime at the landing location","slimeMobSpawnerBlock":"Slime Spawner Block","slimeMobSpawnerBlockDescription":"Place to automatic