,"blackConcreteStairs":"Black Concrete Stairs","colouredChalkStairs":"{{colour}} Chalk Stairs","colouredChalkStairsDescription":"A pastel {{colour}} decorative block","colouredChalkBricksStairs":"{{colour}} Chalk Bricks Stairs","colouredChalkBricksStairsDescription":"A pastel {{colour}} decorative block","noticeboardStanding":"Noticeboard Standing","noticeboardStandingTop":"Noticeboard Standing Top","noticeboardStandingBottom":"Noticeboard Standing Bottom","noticeboardStandingLeft":"Noticeboard Standing Left","noticeboardStandingRight":"Noticeboard Standing Right","noticeboardStandingTopLeft":"Noticeboard Standing Top Left","noticeboardStandingTopRight":"Noticeboard Standing Top Right","noticeboardStandingBottomLeft":"Noticeboard Standing Bottom Left","noticeboardStandingBottomRight":"Noticeboard Standing Bottom Right","noticeboardStandingLeg":"Noticeboard Standing Leg","noticeboardWall":"Noticeboard Wall","noticeboardWallTop":"Noticeboard Wall Top","noticeboardWallBottom":"Noticeboard Wall Bottom","noticeboardWallLeft":"Noticeboard Wall Left","noticeboardWallRight":"Noticeboard Wall Right","noticeboardWallTopLeft":"Noticeboard Wall Top Left","noticeboardWallTopRight":"Noticeboard Wall Top Right","noticeboardWallBottomLeft":"Noticeboard Wall Bottom Left","noticeboardWallBottomRight":"Noticeboard Wall Bottom Right","noticeboard":"Noticeboard","standingNoticeboard":"Standing Noticeboard","toxicWaste":"Toxic Waste","toxicWasteBarrel":"Toxic Waste Barrel","evilLuckyBlock":"Evil Lucky Block","evilLuckyBlockDescription":"Whoever opens it gets something bad.","pureCoalOre":"Pure Coal Ore","pureIronOre":"Pure Iron Ore","pureGoldOre":"Pure Gold Ore","pureDiamondOre":"Pure Diamond Ore","pureMoonstoneOre":"Pure Moonstone Ore"},"game":{"survival":"Survival","creative":"Creative","worlds":"Worlds","worldsDescription":"Create your own world","bloxdHop":"Bloxd Hop","cubeWarfare":"Cube Warfare","evilTower":"Evil Tower","doodleCube":"Doodle Cube","oneBlock":"One Block","skyWars":"Skywars","plots":"Plots","pirates":"Pirates","greenville":"Greenville","bedwars":"Bedwars","bedwarsDuos":"Duos","bedwars4v4v4v4":"Squads","murderMystery":"Murder Mystery","hideAndSeek":"Hide and Seek","infection":"Infection","peaceful":"Peaceful","worldsOpenWorldRecommended":"Open World (recommended)","factions":"Factions","factionsDescription":"Create, join, raid and trade with factions in a persistent open world","bedwarsSolos":"Solos","luckyTowers":"Lucky Towers","rocketObby":"Rocket Obby","rocketSpleef":"Rocket Spleef","bingo":"Bingo","paintball":"Paintball","bridge":"Bridge","2d_classic":"One Block Wide","2dClassicDescription":"All you ever wanted. Survival but now in one less dimension.","bedwarsTrios":"Trios","openWorld":"Open World","sandbox":"Sandbox","rocketObby_sheep":"Sheep","rocketObby_january":"January","rocketObby_sheep_desc":"Use rocket jumps to beat challenging maps! This map is the easiest.","rocketObby_january_desc":"Use rocket jumps to beat challenging maps! This map is a little harder.","survivalDescription":"Fight for survival in multiplayer (smp) worlds by looting, fighting and protecting land or create your own private server for free.","creativeDescription":"Be as creative as you wish by building freely with infinite blocks and custom tools. Start your own free build server to create with friends online.","creativeFlat":"Superflat","creativeFlatDescription":"Build freely in creative mode on an endless flat grass world, a clean canvas for your biggest projects.","bloxdHopDescription":"Bloxd hop is where it all began a pure parkour rush through floating blocks, tight jumps and checkpoints that built the world of bloxd one leap at a time.","cubeWarfareDescription":"Cube warfare throws you into nonstop firefights where sharp aim and fast movement mean the difference between top frag and instant respawn.","evilTowerDescription":"Evil tower dares you to climb through chaos where every floor gets trickier, every jump feels cursed, and one mistake can send you all the way back.","doodleCubeDescription":"Doodle cube blends build battle energy with party-style creativity: race through themes, craft on the fly, and let votes crown the boldest build.","oneBlockDescription":"Survive on one block in the sky and expand your world through unique phases as you collect, craft, and build your island into an empire.","skyWarsDescription":"Skywars throws you into high-stakes battles across floating islands where quick looting, risky pushes and sharp plays are your only way to survive.","plotsDescription":"Plots gives you your own slice of the world to shape, share, and show off starting with a blank canvas for building whatever, wherever, with whoever.","piratesDescription":"Set sail in pirates and dive into chaotic sea fights where skill, timing and a little madness decide who rules the waves and who sinks trying.","greenvilleDescription":"Step into greenville for a chill, social world where you can build a home, earn coins, play mini-games and live the laid-back sandbox life.","bedwarsDuosDescription":"Duo up in bedwars and face off on floating islands, where you and a teammate defend your bed, outsmart enemies, and break theirs to win.","bedwars4v4v4v4Description":"Squad up in bedwars, a pvp game where four-player teams battle on sky islands, defend their bed, and break enemy beds to win the match.","hideAndSeekDescription":"Blend into the map in hide & seek, a tense and playful match where disappearing works until the seekers catch on or catch you.","infectionDescription":"Don\u2019t get infected... or do. infection throws players into a suspenseful match where the virus spreads fast and anyone could turn against you.","peacefulDescription":"Peaceful is a calm sandbox where you explore, build, and gather, with no hostile mobs and no health bar for stress-free play.","bedwarsSolosDescription":"Challenge bedwars solo and battle alone on sky islands, protect your bed at all costs, gather gear, and destroy enemy beds to be the last player standing.","luckyTowersDescription":"jump into lucky towers for fast and chaotic pvp where anything can happen, your gear is random and only one player survives the madness.","rocketSpleefDescription":"Blast into aerial mayhem in rocket spleef where explosions, gliders and pure luck collide in a sky brawl that never touches the ground.","bingoDescription":"Race to fill the board in bingo where fast thinking, lucky finds and risky detours turn every round into a frantic scavenger sprint.","paintballDescription":"Charge into the chaos of paintball where speed, splashes, and sharp aim turn every round into a fight for color and control.","bridgeDescription":"Every second counts in bridge, a back-and-forth battle where you build, defend, and sprint across your own bridge to score before they do.","bedwarsTriosDescription":"Team up in bedwars Trio, a pvp game where three-player squads battle on floating islands, protect their bed, and destroy opponents to claim victory.","murderMysteryDescription":"Trust no one in murder mystery where friends go quiet, roles stay secret, and every round is a guessing game filled with twists and close calls.","luckyBattlegrounds":"Lucky Blocks Battlegrounds","luckyBattlegroundsDescription":"Lucky Blocks arena where you smash blocks for random loot, funny surprises, and wild outcomes while playing with other players in chaotic multiplayer fun!","petSim":"Pet Simulator","petSimDescription":"Build an army of pets, smash crates together, and get rich!","ninetyNineNights":"99 Nights","ninetyNineNightsDescription":"Survive 99 nights in the forest... brave the horrors in this survival game, make camp, search for missing children, and beware what roams in the dark.","duels":"Duels","ranked":"Ranked","rankedPvP":"Ranked PvP","1v1Fights":"1v1 Fights","swordFight":"Sword Fight","buildFight":"Build Fight","bridgeFight":"Bridge Fight","bedFight":"Bed Fight","bedwars4v4":"4v4","bedwars4v4Description":"A ranked pvp bedwars game where four-player teams battle on floating islands, defend their bed, and break enemy beds to win the match.","knockout":"Knockout","knockoutDescription":"Bonk your way to victory in this chaotic boat brawl! Aim, set your power, and launch your boat to knock other players off the platform before they send you flying.","smp":"The Bloxd SMP","smpDescription":"Survive and trade in a persistent multiplayer world with a player-driven marketplace. Buy, sell and collect items using gold.","clutch":"Clutch","clutchDescription":"Pick your loadout, buy upgrades, and outplay your opponents in fast paced shooting combat.","survivalGuns":"Survival with Guns","survivalGunsDescription":"Survival with craftable guns and armed mobs","survivalFactory":"Build a Factory","survivalFactoryDescription":"Automate your factory \ud83c\udfed to build a rocket the fastest! \ud83d\ude80","survivalDayNight":"Day & Night Survival","survivalDayNightDescription":"Fight for survival with a day-night cycle. Use torches to protect your base from the monsters that thrive at night.","survivalFactoryPersistentDescription":"A world that never resets, but with limitations on how many machines you can build per chunk \ud83c\udfed Build rockets to reach the Moon and mine Lunite! \ud83d\ude80","survivalFactoryPersistentVariation":"Persistent","bedwars1v1":"1v1","bedwars1v1Description":"A ranked 1v1 bedwars game. Defend your bed, break your opponent\'s bed, and be the last player standing.","frontline":"Frontline","frontlineDescription":"Capture and hold the points to win the fight. Gear up, pick your kit, hop in a vehicle, and push the line in fast, brutal team combat. A Battlefield-inspired 12v12 FPS with domination objectives, vehicles, and unique class loadouts. Free to play with a full squad.","containmentBreach":"Containment Breach","containmentBreachDescription":"Brave the infested halls of an abandoned research lab and contain the anomaly the before the breach spreads. Free SCP-Foundation inspired co-op pve survival horror: grab some friends, secure the site, get out alive.","skyblockDescription":"Free online Skyblock RPG in your browser. Level up skills, take on quests, defeat dungeon bosses, trade at the auction house and grow your private island.","luckyBedwars":"Lucky Bedwars","ninetyNineNightsEscapeTheForest":"Escape the Forest","ninetyNineNightsTheLongNight":"The Long Night"},"skywarsGame":{"archer":"Archer","builder":"Builder","disco":"Disco","energix":"Energix","healer":"Healer","lumberjack":"Lumberjack","miner":"Miner","scout":"Scout","tank":"Tank","warrior":"Warrior","baseballer":"Baseballer","engineer":"Engineer","farmer":"Farmer","frog":"Frog","ghost":"Ghost","knight":"Knight","pharaoh":"Pharaoh","poisoner":"Poisoner","sniper":"Sniper","snowman":"Snowman","catapult":"Catapult","model":"Model","salmon":"Salmon","slug":"Slug","troll":"Troll","bomber":"Bomber","guardian":"Guardian","wraith":"Wraith","defaultDescription":"Star with basic equipment!","archerDescription":"Start with a bow and arrows!","builderDescription":"Start with wood and stone blocks!","discoDescription":"Build with colourful glass!","energixDescription":"Super strength potions!","healerDescription":"Health and safety first <3","lumberjackDescription":"Start with logs and an axe!","minerDescription":"Start with a golden pickaxe!","scoutDescription":"Start with speedy coconuts!","tankDescription":"Start with wooden armour!","warriorDescription":"Start with a sword!","baseballerDescription":"Hit enemies around and outrun them!","engineerDescription":"Get tools for trapping and exploding your enemies!","farmerDescription":"Bake bread and throw things at your enemies!","frogDescription":"Get ready to bounce with potions!","ghostDescription":"Become invisible and scare your enemies!","knightDescription":"Slay your enemies and protect yourself!","pharaohDescription":"Rule the world with emerald blocks!","poisonerDescription":"Start with splash poison potions!","sniperDescription":"Get a one-shot crossbow!","snowmanDescription":"Everything you need for a snowball fight!","catapultDescription":"Knock your enemies off the map!","modelDescription":"Shuffle up your wardrobe!","salmonDescription":"Become a fish and get water!","slugDescription":"Slow your enemies down!","trollDescription":"Trolls!? In my Skywars!? It\'s more likely than you think...","bomberDescription":"Make your enemies go BOOM!","guardianDescription":"Enhance your defense and build a fortress!","wraithDescription":"Weaken your foes!","selectKitFailureMessage":"You cannot select kits whilst in a game!","maniac":"Maniac","bridger":"Bridger","arrowhead":"Arrowhead","leech":"Leech","resistance":"Resistance","rusher":"Rusher","luckyPick":"Lucky Pick","baker":"Baker","robbery":"Robbery","frost":"Frost","inferno":"Inferno","greenThumb":"Green Thumb","greenThumbDescription":"Quickly grow seeds and saplings","maniacDescription":"Gain {{number}} second(s) of increased damage after kills","bridgerDescription":"{{number}}% chance to recover placed blocks","arrowheadDescription":"{{number}}% chance to immediately recover fired arrows","leechDescription":"Gain {{healAmount}} health after each kill and {{maxHealth}} max health after each kill","resistanceDescription":"Gain {{number}} seconds of damage reduction when the game starts","rusherDescription":"Gain {{number}} seconds of speed when the game starts","luckyPickDescription":"{{number}}% chance of getting an extra drop when mining","bakerDescription":"{{number}}% chance of getting bread after each kill","robberyDescription":"{{number}}% chance of making a player drop their held item when you hit them with your fist","frostDescription":"Slows a player down for {{number}} seconds when you hit them with an arrow","infernoDescription":"{{number}}% chance of getting a fireball after each kill","winMessage":"YOU WON!!! +20 GOLD!!","otherPlayerWinMessage":"{{name}} WON!!!","compassReceivedMessage":"Compass received. Use it to track down remaining players","compassMessage":"Compass given to all alive players.","selectPerkMessage":"You have selected the {{name}} perk!","cantSelectPerkMessage":"You cannot change perks whilst in a game!","goldForKill":"+{{number}} gold for killing {{name}}","killedText":"You were killed by {{name}} :(","chestsReplenished":"Chests replenished.","compassDisplayName":"Nearest Alive Player","compassDescription":"Points to nearest alive player","upgrade":"Upgrade","purchase":"Purchase","upgradeSelectedKillstreak":"Upgrade selected killstreak","purchaseSelectedKillstreak":"Purchase selected killstreak","killstreakMaxed":"Killstreak maxed","selectDifferentKillstreak":"Select a different killstreak to upgrade it","perkSelected":"Selected","perkUpgraded":"Upgraded","perkPurchased":"Purchased","clickedActiveKillstreak":"Cannot change active killstreaks","digger":"Digger","diggerDescription":"Gives level {{number}} mining haste","venom":"Venom","venomDescription":"Rain venom down upon your enemies!","cantUseItemsInCage":"Can\'t use items while in glass cage!"},"kitShop":{"boughtKitMessage":"You bought:","kitSelected":"Selected:","kitSelectedInShop":"{{name}} starter kit selected. Open the shop to select a different kit!","alreadyOwnedKit":"Already owned:","received":"Received:","gemsAmount":"{{number}} gems!","common":"Common","rare":"Rare","epic":"Epic","legendary":"Legendary","mysteryKit":"Mystery Kit","kit":"Kit","mysteryKitDescription":"Unlock a mystery kit!","loot":"Loot"},"sessionBasedGame":{"needMoreThanOneTeam":"Need more than one team to start the game.","playersRemaining":"{{number}} players remaining.","killNotification":"{{name}} was killed by {{name2}}.","playerDied":"{{name}} died.","stayInLobby":"Stay in lobby","startingIn":"Starting in:","spectator":"Spectator","chooseTeam":"Choose Team","joinTeam":"Join {{name}} Team","teamFull":"Team is full.","lobbyOverfull":"Lobby Overfull","lobbyOverfullDescription":"Lobby is overfull. You will be able to play once players leave.","gameStartInSeconds":"Game starting in {{number}} seconds.","startingGame":"Starting game.","lobbyFullStartInSeconds":"Lobby full, starting game in {{number}} seconds.","mapChanged":"Map changed to {{name}}.","startingNewGameInSeconds":"Starting new game in {{number}} seconds.","spectate":"Spectate","cantChangeBlocksWhileSpectating":"Can\'t change blocks while spectating","goldOnGgMessage":"+{{gold}} gold for saying gg!","chooseColour":"Choose Colour","joinColour":"Select {{name}} Colour","colourFull":"Colour is full.","mapVoted":"{{map}} won the vote, selected by {{player}}.","votedForMap":"Successfully voted for {{map}}."},"perksPlugin":{"maxed":"Maxed"},"stats":{"kills":"Kills","wins":"Wins","gamesPlayed":"Games Played","games":"Games","goals":"Goals","topThreeFinishes":"Top 3 Finishes"},"plotsGame":{"addPlayerToPlot":"Add Player to Plot {{number}}","addPlayerToPlotDescription":"Grant a player access to your plot","playerCanNowAccessPlot":"{{name}} can now access your plot","removePlayerFromPlot":"Remove Player from Plot {{number}}","removePlayerFromPlotDescription":"Revoke a player\'s access to your plot","playerCanNoLongerAccessPlot":"{{name}} can no longer access your plot","goToOwnedPlot":"Go To Owned Plot","goToOwnedPlotDescription":"Go to a plot you own","teleportedToYourPlotNum":"Teleported to your plot #{{number}}","getNewPlot":"Get New Plot ({{number}}/{{maxPlotNum}})","getNewPlotDescription":"Get a new plot to build on","boughtNewPlot":"You have a new plot (#{{number}})","goToSharedPlot":"Go To Shared Plot","goToSharedPlotDescription":"Go to a plot you have been granted access to","teleportedToOtherPlayerPlot":"Teleported to {{name}}\'s plot (#{{number}})","tpToPlot":"Tp To Plot","tpToPlotDescription":"Tp to any plot in the world using the plot coords","plot":"Plot:","plotOwner":"Owner:","cannotSpawnMobInPlotOwnedByOtherPlayer":"Cannot spawn mob in plot owned by other player."},"infectionGame":{"nextSectionUnlocked":"Next section unlocked!","humansHaveUnlockedNextSection":"The humans have unlocked the next section!","human":"Human","zombie":"Zombie","humanDescription":"Follow the arrows and get through the obstacles before the zombies infect you!","zombieDescription":"Kill all the humans before they escape! Happy hunting!","youAreTheLastHuman":"You are the last human!","tapScreenToPay":"Tap screen to pay","pressFToPay":"Press f to pay","tapScreenToBuyGun":"Tap screen to buy {{gun}}","pressFToBuyGun":"Press f to buy {{gun}}","humansWin":"Humans win!","zombiesWin":"Zombies win!","humanTeamWinAward":"You escaped the Zombies!","zombieTeamWinAward":"You stopped the Humans from escaping!","firstKillAward":"First kill","finalKillAward":"Final kill","finalHumanAward":"You were the last Human alive","finalThreeHumanAward":"You were one of the last three Humans alive","firstZombieAward":"You were one of the first Zombies"},"worldBorderPlugin":{"nearWorldBorderWarning":"You are near the world border (>{{radius}}).","teleportedBackWarning":"You will be teleported back if you go outside the border.","firstTimeJoinWarning":"Since you were last online, a world border has been added (>{{radius}}).","gracePeriodWarning":"You have {{gracePeriod}} mins to move your stuff into the safe zone."},"oneblockGame":{"welcomeMessage":"Welcome!","skillNotReadyYet":"Skill is not ready yet!","minSkillLvlNotification":"You need to be level {{minSkillLevel}} to use this skill!","skillExpGain":"+{{skill}} Level exp","skillLevelGain":"+{{skill}} Level {{level}}","event":"EVENT","place":"place","theFastest":"the fastest","unscramble":"unscramble","type":"Type","typed":"typed","unscrambled":"unscrambled","placed":"placed","theFastestIn":"the fastest in\\n","phase":"Phase","nextPhase":"Next Phase","blocks":"Blocks mined","newPhase":"New Phase","lucky":"Lucky","skill":"Skill","active":"Active","ready":"Ready","mining":"Mining","digging":"Digging","chopping":"Chopping","phaseForest":"Forest","phasePlains":"Plains","phaseJungle":"Jungle","phaseUnderground":"Underground","phaseWinter":"Winter","phaseRainbow":"Rainbow","phaseOcean":"Ocean","phaseSwamp":"Swamp","phaseDungeon":"Dungeon","phaseDesert":"Desert","phaseVolcano":"Volcano","phasePlenty":"Plenty","phaseDesolation":"Desolation","phaseMoon":"Moon","cannotChangePhase":"Cannot change phase until unlocking all phases","changedPhase":"Changed Phase!","locked":"Locked","islandPhases":"Island Phases","skills":"Skills","islandConfig":"Island Config","playerIslands":"Player Islands","minSkill":"Reach level {{minSkillLevel}} to unlock Skill","miningSkillName":"Super Mining","miningSkillDescription":"Mine everything fast, with extra drops and a chance to strike ore!","duration":"Duration","rightClickToActivate":"Right click to activate","diggingSkillName":"Super Digging","diggingSkillDescription":"Dig at lightning speed, blocks drop themselves (silk touch)!","choppingSkillName":"Mega Chop","choppingSkillDescription":"Chop fast and find way more chests!","renameIsland":"Rename Island","renameIslandDescription":"Change your island name.","change":"Change","nameTooLong":"Name is too long!","setIslandNameMsg":"Set island name to {{islandName}}","nameTooShort":"Name is too short!","allowEdit":"Allow Edit","allowEditDescription":"Allow edit access to your island","allowEditWarning":"WARNING: This will allow anyone to take your blocks. Use at your own risk.","allowEditClickMsg":"Allow edit toggled!","prohibitEdit":"Prohibit Edit","prohibitEditDescription":"Remove edit access to your island","teleported":"Teleported!","reachPortalBeforeTeleport":"Reach your portal before using teleport!","island":"Island","totalBlocksMined":"Total blocks mined","doubleDropChance":"Double drop chance","playerIsland":"{{player}}\'s Island","oneblockNametagWelcome":"I\'m your One Block, break me!","shop_portalStatusTitle":"Portal status","shop_portalStatusDescription":"Set the status of your portal","shop_portalStatusChangedMessage":"Portal status changed!","maverickDialogue1_1":"Hey! I seem to be lost.","maverickDialogue1_2":"Could you tell me where I am?","maverickDialogue2_1":"I came from a village","maverickDialogue2_2":"that had a lot of portals.","maverickDialogue2_3":"Something must\'ve gone wrong.","maverickDialogue3_1":"You have no idea?! Oh well then,","maverickDialogue3_2":"I\'ll have a look around.","maverickDialogue3_3":"Let me know if you need any help.","maverickDialogue3_4":"I can help you with your portal.","portalConfig":"Portal Config","phaseHills":"Hills","phaseVillage":"Village","phaseBlossom":"Blossom","phaseCaves":"Caves","phaseRuins":"Ruins","phaseFrozen":"Frozen","phaseMountains":"Mountains","blocksToUnlock":"Blocks to unlock","portalSkinDefault":"Default","shop_portalSkinChangedMessage":"Portal Skin Changed!","islandClosed":"Closed","islandNotFound":"Cannot find the island. Report to discord if you see this often.","alreadyLoadedIsland":"This island is already loaded.","islandManager":"Island Manager","islandAccess":"Island Access","loadIsland":"Load Island","loadIslandDescription":"Switch to another island save.","newIsland":"Create New Island","newIslandDescription":"Create a brand new One Block island.","importIsland":"Import Island","importIslandDescription":"To import your island from another lobby, please visit that lobby and it will be imported automatically.","deleteIsland":"Delete Island","deleteIslandDescription":"Delete your current island. This action is IRREVERSIBLE. Type your island name \\"{{islandName}}\\" to confirm.","islandLoaded":"Successfully loaded island.","islandNameMismatch":"Island name does not match. Deletion cancelled.","cannotDeleteLastIsland":"You cannot delete your only island. Create a new island first.","islandDeleted":"Successfully deleted island.","maxIslandsReached":"You have reached the maximum number of islands. Please delete one before creating another.","portalSkin":"Portal Skin","load":"Load","loadingIslandsTooQuickly":"You are switching islands too quickly! Please try again in 15 seconds.","shop_depositTitle":"Deposit all coins","shop_depositButton":"Deposit","shop_depositDescription":"Coins in bank: {{currentInBank}}. Unlock portal skins with more coins in the bank!","shop_depositMessage":"All coins deposited!","shop_withdrawTitle":"Withdraw coins","shop_withdrawButton":"Withdraw","shop_withdrawDescription":"Withdraw given number of coins from bank","shop_withdrawMessage":"Coins withdrawn!","shop_withdrawSomeMessage":"Withdrew {{coinsWithdrawn}} coins. Inventory full!","shop_withdrawNotEnoughCoins":"Can\'t withdraw that many coins","shop_withdrawNegative":"Need to withdraw more than 0 coins","shop_withdrawNotNumber":"Input a number to withdraw","portal_gold_0_description":"Unlock portal skin with 1000 coins in the bank","portal_gold_1_description":"Unlock portal skin with 50000 coins in the bank","portal_gold_2_description":"Unlock portal skin with 1000000 coins in the bank","portal_gold_0":"Wealthy","portal_gold_1":"Loaded","portal_gold_2":"Filthy Rich","maverickDialogue1_1_1":"Glad you could join us!","maverickDialogue1_1_2":"It was too quiet","maverickDialogue1_2_1":"Welcome to One Village!","maverickDialogue1_2_2":"I can remember when I learned my","maverickDialogue1_2_3":"first spell right on that bridge","maverickDialogue1_3_1":"I hope I don\'t get lost again,","maverickDialogue1_3_2":"I like this village","bankerDialogue1_1_1":"Hello! I\'m Bling Bling the banker!","bankerDialogue1_1_2":"The best banker in this dimension","bankerDialogue2_1_1":"You can deposit gold coins here,","bankerDialogue2_1_2":"no need to spend them now","bankerDialogue2_2_1":"Just let me keep them safe...","bankerDialogue3_1_1":"I\'m good at keeping gold safe,","bankerDialogue3_1_2":"I have been in this business forever","bankerDialogue4_1_1":"GIVE ME ALL YOUR GOLD","bankerDialogue4_1_2":"Whoops, haha, that came out wrong","bankerDialogue4_2_1":"I mean, may I please have your gold?","bankerDialogue4_2_2":"As a banker, I know how to handle it best","homePortal":"Teleport home","shop_hostileMobsTitle":"Hostile mobs","shop_hostileMobsDescription":"Enable/Disable hostile mobs spawning when breaking One Block","shop_hostileMobsChangedMessage":"Hostile mobs status changed!","farmerDialogue1_1_1":"Glad you could join us!","farmerDialogue1_1_2":"I\'m Fred the farmer,","farmerDialogue1_1_3":"an old friend of Maverick\'s","farmerDialogue1_2_1":"Feel free to have a look at my wares","farmerDialogue1_2_2":"All our prices are udderly ridiculous","farmerDialogue2_1_1":"Quit horsing around!","farmerDialogue2_1_2":"I\'m feeling a bit sheepish","farmerDialogue3_1_1":"Great season for growing crops","farmerDialogue3_1_2":"don\'t you think?","farmerDialogue4_1_1":"Check out our selection of mobs!","farmerDialogue4_1_2":"We\'ve got all kinds of stuff here","farmerDialogue4_2_1":"You can get yourself a new friend here.","farmerDialogue4_2_2":"Or something bit more dangerous","farmerDialogue4_2_3":"if you\'re looking for a challenge","inventoryFullPurchase":"Inventory full, cannot purchase! Coins refunded","newPhaseHostileMobs":"This phase contains hostile mobs, enable them in the shop!","islandSettings":"Island Settings","role_visitor":"Visitor","role_miner":"Miner","role_builder":"Builder","addVisitor":"Add Visitor","addVisitorDescription":"Allow a player to visit your island even when the portal is closed.","addMiner":"Add Miner","addMinerDescription":"Allow a player to visit your island and mine the One Block, but not interact with anything else.","addBuilder":"Add Builder","addBuilderDescription":"Allow a player to visit and fully edit your island. WARNING: Builders can take your blocks and chests.","removeRole":"Remove Role","removeRoleDescription":"Remove a player\'s role on your island.","roleGranted":"Set {{player}}\'s role to","roleReceived":"{{player}} set your role to","roleRemoved":"Removed {{player}}\'s role from your island.","roleRemovedTarget":"Your role on {{player}}\'s island has been removed.","shop_rewardedAdTitle":"Watch Ad for Coins","shop_rewardedAdDescription":"Watch an ad to receive {{coins}} coins!","shop_rewardedAdCooldown":"Available again in {{minutes}} min","ftueMineFirstBlock":"Mine your One Block!","ftueMineMoreBlocks":"Mine 5 more blocks","ftueCollectItems":"Pick up your blocks","ftuePlaceBlocks":"Place 5 blocks to expand your island","ftueMineEvenMore":"Mine 10 more blocks","ftueTaskComplete":"Task Complete!","ftueStageComplete":"Great start! You\'ve got the basics!","ftueStageHeading":"TUTORIAL","ftueHintSwapTools":"Swap tools when needed","ftueHintMineMore":"Mine more if needed","ftueHintDontFall":"Try not to fall off!","ftueStage2Heading":"PROGRESSION","ftueReachPlains":"Mine blocks to reach the Plains phase","ftueCollectCoins":"Collect 3 Gold Coins from chests","ftueLevelUpSkills":"Keep mining to level up your skills","ftueActivateSkill":"Hold a Pickaxe and right-click to activate","ftueHintNewPhases":"New phases unlock new blocks and mobs","ftueHintSaveCoins":"Save these for later","ftueHintSkillsUnlock":"Skills unlock at level 5","ftueHintSkillCooldown":"Skills make you mine faster!","ftueStage2Complete":"New phase unlocked!","ftueStage3Heading":"SKILLS","ftueStage3Complete":"Skills unlocked! You\'re making great progress!","ftueStage4Heading":"THE HUB","ftueVisitHub":"Walk into your portal to visit the Hub","ftueVisitOtherIsland":"Visit another player\'s island","ftueHintVisitOtherIsland":"Use the shop menu or a portal in the Hub","ftueReturnHome":"Return to your island","ftueOpenPortal":"Type /open in chat to open your portal","ftueHintPortalNearby":"Bridge over to the portal island close by","ftueHintHomePortal":"Use the portals or type /home in the chat","ftueHintLetOthersVisit":"Other players can visit your island!","ftueStage4Complete":"You\'ve discovered the Hub!","ftueStage5Heading":"RESOURCES","ftueReachHills":"Mine blocks to reach the Hills phase","ftueCollectOre":"Keep mining to collect Raw Iron","ftueExpandIsland":"Expand your island","ftueCraftIronPickaxe":"Craft an Iron Pickaxe","ftueHintCraftFromOre":"Use Iron Ore and Sticks at a crafting table","ftueHintRarerBlocks":"Higher phases have rarer blocks","ftueCraftStonePickaxe":"Craft a Stone Pickaxe","ftueHintCraftFromStone":"Use stone and planks at a crafting table","ftueHintOreFromPhases":"Ores appear in higher phases","ftueCollectCoal":"Collect Coal","ftueHintCoalFromOre":"Mine Coal Ore from the One Block","ftueSmeltIron":"Smelt Raw Iron into Iron Bars","ftueHintBuildFurnace":"Craft a Furnace to smelt ore","ftueHintBuildBig":"Build up and out!","ftueStage5Complete":"You\'re upgrading your gear!","ftueStage6Heading":"MOBS","ftueTameMob":"Tame a mob by feeding it an Apple","ftueHintTameMob":"Feed an animal to tame it","ftueKillMobs":"Defeat 3 mobs.\\nKeep mining to spawn more","ftueKeepMining":"Keep mining to discover new phases","ftueHintMobDrops":"Mobs drop useful items","ftueHintNewPhasesMobs":"New phases bring new mobs","ftueStage6Complete":"You\'ve conquered the island wildlife!","ftueStage7Heading":"SHOP AND BANK","ftueDepositCoins":"Visit the Banker in the Hub\\nto deposit coins","ftueKeepExploring":"Keep exploring!","ftueBuyFromShop":"Buy something from a shop","ftueHintBuyFromShop":"Shops are found in the Hub","ftueHintBankSafe":"Your bank balance is safe forever","ftueStage7Complete":"Tutorial complete! Enjoy One Block!","quests":"Quests","quest_dailyTitle":"Daily Quest","quest_weeklyTitle":"Weekly Quest","quest_noQuestYet":"Complete the tutorial to unlock quests!","quest_progress":"Progress","quest_reward":"Reward","quest_claim":"Claim Reward","quest_claimed":"Claimed!","quest_depositCoins":"Deposit {{target}} coins in the bank","quest_mineBlocks":"Mine {{target}} blocks","quest_mineBlocksInPhases":"Mine {{target}} blocks in 3 different phases","quest_winMinigame":"Win a minigame event","quest_breakChests":"Break {{target}} One Block chests","quest_chopWood":"Chop {{target}} wood blocks","quest_defeatMobType":"Defeat a {{mobType}}","quest_placeBlocks":"Place {{target}} blocks on your island","quest_visitIslands":"Visit {{target}} other players\' islands","quest_useEachSkill":"Use each active skill once","quest_mineDiamonds":"Mine {{target}} diamond ore","quest_findHubChests":"Find {{target}} chests in the Hub","guildPainter":"Painter\'s Guild","guildMonsterHunter":"Monster Hunter\'s Guild","guildFarmer":"Farmer\'s Guild","guildUpgrade":"Upgrade Guild","guildUpgradeButton":"Upgrade","guildUnlocks":"Unlocks:","guildUpgradeCostLabel":"Cost:","guildUpgradeSuccess":"Guild upgraded!","guildUpgradeMissingItems":"You don\'t have the required items!","guildTier":"Current tier","guildMaxTier":"Max Tier","guildMaxTierButton":"Maxed","quest_spendGold":"Spend gold in the Hub","quest_defeatHostileMobs":"Kill hostile mobs","quest_winMinigames":"Win minigames","quest_gainSkillLevels":"Gain skill levels","spencerDialogue1_1_1":"Welcome to the Painter\'s Guild!","spencerDialogue1_1_2":"Every block is a canvas if you squint hard enough","spencerDialogue5_1_1":"Need something painted? I\'m your man.","spencerDialogue5_1_2":"Just don\'t ask about the ceiling incident.","spencerDialogue2_1_1":"Did I ever tell you I painted Maverick\'s house?","spencerDialogue2_1_2":"He wanted \'Ocean Sunrise\'.","spencerDialogue2_1_3":"It came out more like \'Swamp at Dusk\'.","spencerDialogue3_1_1":"I see colours everywhere.","spencerDialogue3_1_2":"It\'s a gift. Also a problem","spencerDialogue3_1_3":"when trying to sleep.","spencerDialogue4_1_1":"My art teacher said I had \'unique vision\'.","spencerDialogue4_1_2":"Pretty sure that was code for","spencerDialogue4_1_3":"\'please stop eating the paints\'.","lorenzoDialogue1_1_1":"The name\'s Lorenzo.","lorenzoDialogue1_1_2":"Monster hunter by trade.","lorenzoDialogue1_1_3":"Mob drop seller... also by trade.","lorenzoDialogue1_1_4":"He\'s the one who told me to set up here.","lorenzoDialogue1_2_1":"Good thing too,","lorenzoDialogue1_2_2":"this village could use someone with my expertise.","lorenzoDialogue2_1_1":"Back in my adventuring days,","lorenzoDialogue2_1_2":"Maverick once teleported us","lorenzoDialogue2_1_3":"into a chicken coop by accident.","lorenzoDialogue2_1_4":"We don\'t talk about it.","lorenzoDialogue3_1_1":"You want monsters dealt with?","lorenzoDialogue3_1_2":"I\'m your guy.","lorenzoDialogue3_1_3":"Reasonable rates. Unreasonable bravery.","lorenzoDialogue4_1_1":"People ask how I stay so calm","lorenzoDialogue4_1_2":"around dangerous creatures.","lorenzoDialogue4_2_1":"The secret? I\'m not calm at all.","lorenzoDialogue4_2_2":"I\'m just very good at pretending.","gillDialogue1_1_1":"Hey there! I\'m Gill.","gillDialogue1_1_2":"Fred\'s partner in crime.","gillDialogue1_1_3":"Well, partner in farming, anyway.","gillDialogue1_2_1":"He handles the animals,","gillDialogue1_2_2":"I handle the crops.","gillDialogue1_2_3":"We try not to swap.","gillDialogue2_1_1":"Fred thinks he\'s the better farmer.","gillDialogue2_1_2":"I let him believe that.","gillDialogue2_1_3":"Keeps him motivated.","gillDialogue3_1_1":"Come check out our finest produce!","gillDialogue3_1_2":"Freshly grown, hand-picked,","gillDialogue3_1_3":"and only slightly talked to.","gillDialogue4_1_1":"Fred and I have been farming","gillDialogue4_1_2":"since before Maverick showed up.","gillDialogue4_2_1":"He brought all these magical portals.","gillDialogue4_2_2":"I just wanted a quiet life","gillDialogue4_2_3":"and some turnips.","lorenzoDialogue5_1_1":"Maverick and I used to adventure together.","lorenzoDialogue5_1_2":"He\'s the one who told me to set up here.","lorenzoDialogue5_2_1":"Good thing too,","lorenzoDialogue5_2_2":"this village could use someone with my expertise.","nameAlreadyExists":"You already have an island with that name!","quest_unlockPhase":"Unlock a new phase","quest_defeatMobsWithoutDying":"Defeat {{target}} mobs without dying","mine":"Mine","mined":"mined","blocksWord":"blocks","guessTheWord":"Guess the word","guessed":"guessed","backwards":"backwards","trivia":"Trivia","answered":"answered","correctlyIn":"correctly in\\n","triviaPhaseCount":"How many phases are there in One Block?","triviaPortalMage":"What is the name of the Portal Mage?","triviaMostCompressedMessyStone":"What is the most compressed Messy Stone?","triviaLongestBlockName":"What is the longest block name in a One Block phase?","farming":"Farming","farmingSkillName":"Harvest Frenzy","farmingSkillDescription":"Auto-harvest nearby crops, instantly ripen immature crops, with bonus produce and gold crops!","goldCropChance":"Gold crop chance","goldCropShort":"Gold","sellGoldCrops":"Sell Gold Crops","sellGoldCropsDescription":"Sell all {{count}} of your Gold Crops for {{price}} coins each.","soldGoldCrops":"Sold {{amount}} Gold Crops for {{coins}} coins!","noGoldCrops":"You have no Gold Crops to sell.","rotatingTraderCategoryDescription":"Stock rotates daily (UTC). Rare finds don\'t stay long!","rotatingTraderResetHours":"{{hours}} hours left","rotatingTraderResetMinutes":"{{minutes}} minutes left","rotatingTraderResetSeconds":"{{seconds}} seconds left","rotatingTraderBuyDescription":"{{unitPrice}} coins each.","rotatingTraderSellDescription":"Sell all {{count}} for {{price}} coins each.","rotatingTraderSellTitle":"Sell {{itemName}}","rotatingTraderPurchasesRemaining":"Purchases left today: {{remaining}}/{{max}}","rotatingTraderSoldOut":"Sold out","rotatingTraderNoItemsToSell":"You have none of today\'s wanted item.","rotatingTraderSoldItems":"Sold {{amount}} items for {{coins}} coins!","rotatingTraderOfferExpired":"That offer has expired. Stock has rotated!","wrenDialogue1_1_1":"Fresh stock, new prices \u2014 every day.","wrenDialogue1_1_2":"Grab it before midnight UTC.","wrenDialogue2_1_1":"I travel between lobbies with the same cart.","wrenDialogue2_1_2":"Everyone sees the same deals. Fair\'s fair.","wrenDialogue3_1_1":"Sometimes I buy, sometimes I sell.","wrenDialogue3_1_2":"Check back tomorrow if you miss out.","buyHoeDescription":"A hoe lets you activate the Farming skill.","closedPortalBlocked":"Portal closed","closedPortalClosedLabel":"Portal closed","closedPortalEditorAccess":" \u2014 you and your builders can still enter","guildUpgradeMissingSkill":"You don\'t have the required skill level!","guildUpgradeSkillRequirementLabel":"Requires:","inventoryFullSellGoldCrops":"Inventory is too full to hold the coins from selling Gold Crops.","soldGoldCropsInventoryFull":"Sold {{amount}} Gold Crops for {{coins}} coins. Inventory too full to sell the remaining.","soldGoldCropsSomeToBank":"Sold {{amount}} Gold Crops for {{coins}} coins! Your inventory was full, so {{overflow}} went to your bank.","rotatingTraderSoldItemsSomeToBank":"Sold {{amount}} items for {{coins}} coins! Your inventory was full, so {{overflow}} went to your bank."},"greenvilleGame":{"welcomeMessage":"Welcome!","teleportedHome":"Teleported home!","recentActionText":"You can\'t do that right now!","joinHelperMessage":"Press B to choose your starting house. Take the portal to the town square to earn gold!","isleOfGrove":"Isle of Grove","prohibitedArea":"This area cannot be visited yet!","mood":"Mood","energy":"Energy","restLevel":"Rest Level","jobs":"Jobs","market":"Market","demolition":"Demolition","mining":"Mining","woodcutting":"Woodcutting","farming":"Farming","totalLevel":"Total Level","redWoolDescription":"Used to eliminate players in Parkour Mode","yellowWoolDescription":"Used to set checkpoints in Parkour Mode","lightBlueWoolDescription":"Used to set start block in Parkour Mode","orangeWoolDescription":"Used to set end block in Parkour Mode","flowerPackDescription":"Gives two random sets of three flowers","woolPackDescription":"Gives two random sets of five wool blocks","arenaWelcomeMesage":"Welcome to the Arena! Battle other players here","arenaRewardMessage":"Eliminated {{opponent}}! You have {{eliminationCount}} eliminations. Rewarded {{goldReward}} gold.","demolitionWelcomeMessage":"Welcome to demolition! Help destroy blocks and earn money. You have been equipped with a booster to jump more, try it!","demolitionPowerBoost":"POWER BOOST!","rewardMessage":"Great job, earned {{goldEarned}} gold!","rewardMessageWithExp":"Great job, earned {{goldEarned}} gold and {{expEarned}} exp!","demolitionAdvice":"Break more blocks! Remember you can multi-jump!","demolitionBigRewardMessage":"Demolished building, earned {{goldEarned}} gold","demolitionBigRewardMessageWithExp":"Demolished building, earned {{goldEarned}} gold and {{expEarned}} exp","demolitionPower":"Power","demolitionPoints":"Points","shopAdvice":"You can sell items you collect on the shop!","marketWelcomeMessage":"Welcome to the market! Help customers and earn gold. Find some {{block}}!","marketNewBlock":"Now find some {{block}}!","marketEarningPower":"Earning Power","marketMoneyBoost":"MONEY BOOST!","lowMoodMessage":"Mood is low! Getting decreased earnings. Rest at a bed to increase mood.","miningWelcomeMessage":"Welcome to Mining! Mine blocks and return them to the camp to earn riches!","miningInsideMineMessage":"You must be inside the mine!","miningMineralTooAdvanced":"The mineral is too advanced to mine, level up first!","miningBackpackFull":"Backpack full, get to the surface to sell!","miningStuckKeyboard":"Stuck? Press F to teleport up!","miningStuckMobile":"Stuck? Press the \'Up\' button to teleport up!","miningDepth":"Depth","miningValue":"Value","miningBackpack":"Backpack","miningMineCollapsed":"The mine collapsed! New treasure awaits","spleefWelcome":"Welcome to Spleef! Make all other players fall to win. 2 players needed for game to start","spleefPlayerWonGame":"{{player}} won the game!","spleefYouWon":"You won! Earned {{goldEarned}} gold","spleefEliminatedPlayer":"You eliminated {{player}}! Earned {{goldEarned}} gold","spleefEliminations":"Eliminations","spleefWins":"Wins","spleefGameStartCounter":"Game starting in {{seconds}}","townSquare":"Town Square","arena":"Arena","mapleWoods":"Maple Woods","wheatFields":"Wheat Fields","haybaleValley":"Haybale Valley","aspenForest":"Aspen Forest","fastTravelDescription":"Travel to {{location}}","fastTravelBoughtMessage":"Traveled to {{location}}!","plotWoodenHouse":"Wooden House","plotMedievalHouse":"Medieval House","plotHobbitHole":"Hobbit Hole","plotEmptyPlot":"Empty Plot","plotStarterParkourPlot":"Starter Parkour Plot","plotModernHouse":"Modern House","plotModernHouse2":"Modern House 2","plotPvPArena":"PvP Arena","plotJapaneseHouse":"Japanese House","plotModernHouse3":"Modern House 3","plotGatedWoodenHouse":"Gated Wooden House","plotCountryHouse":"Country House","plotGreenMushroomHouse":"Green Mushroom House","plotRedMushroom":"Red Mushroom","plotCastle":"Castle","plotTreehouse":"Treehouse","plotParkourBase":"Parkour Base","plotEmptyPlot2":"Empty Plot 2","plotEmptyPlot3":"Empty Plot 3","unlockHouse":"Unlock {{houseName}}.","onHouseBought":"{{houseName}} unlocked.","houseChangeDescription":"Change your home to {{houseName}}","houseOnChange":"House Changed to {{houseName}}","locked":"Locked","travel":"Travel","onBuyMessage":"{{name}} bought!","unlockedFastTravel":"Unlocked fast travel for {{location}}!","bedDescription":"Bed level {{level}}\\nResting increases earnings\\nBetter bed level = more earnings","homeHostParty":"Host PARTY!","homeHostPartyBuyText":"Host!","homeHostPartyDescription":"Invite everyone to your house","homeHostPartyClickMessage":"Invited everyone to your house!","homeRenameHouse":"Rename House","homeRenameHouseDescription":"Change your house name","homeRenameHouseClickMessage":"Change","homeAllowEntry":"Allow Entry","homeAllowEntryDescription":"Toggle access to your home","homePvP":"Player Fighting","homePvPDescription":"Enable player vs player combat in your home","homeParkour":"Parkour","homeParkourDescription":"Enable parkour blocks in your home","homeCannotPlaceBed":"Cannot place a bed in plot border","homeAvoidRedWool":"Avoid the red wool!","homeParkourStuck":"Stuck? Type {{command}} to leave the house","homePlayerCompletedParkour":"{{player}} completed parkour in {{time}} seconds!","homeParkourModeOn":"Parkour mode is on! Red wool eliminates you and yellow wool activates checkpoints","homeNotAllowedEntry":"You are not allowed to enter {{player}}\'s house","nameTooLong":"Name too long!","homeNameChange":"Set house name to {{houseName}}","homeInvitePlayersTimer":"You can invite players in {{time}} seconds!","homePartyJoinRequest":"{{player}} is hosting a party! Join?","homeMustUnlockSetting":"Must unlock {{settingName}} from shop first!","homeNotInAHouse":"You are not in a house","homeTeleportedOut":"Teleported out!","homeVisitorsAllowed":"Visitors allowed","homeTimer":"Timer","homePlayerNotRecognised":"Player name not recognised","homePlayersHouse":"{{player}}\'s House","homeParkourCheckpointSaved":"Checkpoint saved","prohibitEdit":"Prohibit Edit","prohibitEditDescription":"Remove edit access to your house","prohibitEditOnBought":"Allow edit toggled!","prohibitEditRemove":"Removed {{player}} from your plot editors list.","prohibitEditYouWereRemoved":"You have been removed from {{player}}\'s plot editors list.","enteringZone":"Entering {{zoneName}} zone","home":"Home","luck":"Luck","fastTravel":"Fast Travel","houses":"Houses","sell":"Sell","houseConfig":"House Config","packs":"Packs","rewards":"Rewards","earnings":"Earnings","watchAd":"Watch Ad","noThanks":"No Thanks","thanksForWatching":"Thanks for watching!","jobIncomeBoost":"{{percent}}% Job Income","jobIncomeBoostDescription":"Watch an ad for {{percent}}% more job income for {{minutes}} minutes.","jobIncomeBoostPrompt":"Watch an ad for {{percent}}% more job income for {{minutes}} minutes!","jobIncomeBoostActiveDescription":"{{percent}}% job income boost active!\\nTime remaining: {{time}}","jobIncomeBoostActiveButton":"Active ({{time}})","jobIncomeBoostActivated":"{{percent}}% job income boost activated for {{minutes}} minutes!","jobIncomeBoostAlreadyActive":"Your job income boost is already active!","freeCoins":"Free Coins","freeCoinsDescription":"Watch an ad for {{amount}} coins.","freeC