"metricUnrankedInfo":"This game hasn\'t placed within {{category}} yet. It needs a minimum number of plays before it is ranked.","sectionCurrentPlayers":"Current Players","sectionRankingMetrics":"{{days}} Day Metrics","rankingMetricsBanner":"A game\'s rank is determined by average plays per day played, average session length, and sessions per player, measured over the {{range}}.","sectionHistoricalMetrics":"Historical Metrics","metricCcu":"Current Players","metricCcuInfo":"How many people are playing your game right now.","metricFavouritesInfo":"How many players have favourited your game, counted since it was published.","metricTotalPlays":"Total Plays","metricUniquePlayers":"Unique Players","metricTotalPlaysInfo":"How many times this game was played over the {{range}}.","metricAvgSession":"Average Session Length","metricAvgSessionInfo":"How long the average play session lasted over the {{range}}.","metricSessionsPerPlayer":"Sessions Per Player","metricSessionsPerPlayerInfo":"The average number of play sessions each player started over the {{range}}. A value of 1 means players did not come back after their first session, so the higher this is the more players are returning.","failedToLoadStats":"Failed to load analytics for this game","statsUnavailable":"Unavailable","lastNDays":"Last {{days}} days","noData":"No data","noDataForRange":"No data recorded in this range","chartPlaysInfo":"Plays recorded each day. A gap means no data was recorded for that day, which is different from a day with zero plays.","chartUniquePlayersInfo":"How many different players played each day. A player who returns several times in one day is counted once.","chartAvgSessionInfo":"The average length of a play session each day, across every player who played that day.","chartCcu":"Players Over Time","chartCcuInfo":"How many people were playing this game over the selected period, shown in your local time. Longer periods are averaged into wider buckets.","leaderboard":"Leaderboard","leaderboardBanner":"The highest ranked games, determined by plays, session length and sessions/player.","leaderboardCustomGames":"Custom Games","leaderboardAllGames":"All Games","leaderboardAllCategories":"All Categories","leaderboardEmpty":"No games are ranked here yet","failedToLoadLeaderboard":"Failed to load the leaderboard","leaveStudio":"Leave Studio","createGameInStudio":"Create Game in Studio","metricAvgDailyPlays":"Average Plays Per Day","metricAvgDailyPlaysInfo":"Average plays on days this game had activity over the {{range}}.","leaderboardMetricsBanner":"Statistics are averaged over the last {{days}} days. Click on a custom game to dig into its stats.","leaderboardPlaysPerDay":"Plays / Day","leaderboardSessionLength":"Session Length","leaderboardSessionsPerPlayer":"Sessions / Player","leaderboardDormantGames":"Dormant Games","leaderboardDormantBanner":"Games nobody is playing right now, ordered by how many players have favourited them - old games that could be worth reviving.","sectionSessionDropoff":"Session Dropoff","sessionDropoffBanner":"How long players stay before they leave, measured over the {{range}}. Every session starts at 100%, and the curve falls as players stop playing.","chartSessionDropoff":"Players Still Playing","chartSessionDropoffInfo":"The share of play sessions still going after each minute, over the {{range}}. A steep early fall means players are leaving in the first few minutes, and a long flat tail means the ones who stay keep playing.","metricShortSessions":"Left Within {{minutes}} Minutes","metricShortSessionsInfo":"The share of play sessions that ended before {{minutes}} minutes, over the {{range}}. These are players who left almost as soon as they arrived, so bringing this down is usually the fastest way to grow your playtime.","metricMedianSession":"Median Session Length","metricMedianSessionInfo":"Half of all play sessions were shorter than this and half were longer, over the {{range}}. Usually lower than the average session length, because a few very long sessions pull the average up.","metricLongSessions":"Played {{minutes}} Minutes Or More","metricLongSessionsInfo":"The share of play sessions that lasted at least {{minutes}} minutes, over the {{range}}. These are the players who settled in to play properly.","dropoffSampleSize":"{{sessions}} sessions","dropoffTooltipMinute":"{{minutes}} into a session","dropoffTooltipSessions":"{{sessions}} of {{totalSessions}} sessions","liveCcu":"{{players}} playing","publishedOn":"Published {{date}}","lastUpdatedOn":"Last Updated {{date}}","lastUpdatedInfo":"When this game\'s world was last saved. Saving the world closes every lobby of the game so its players rejoin on the new version. Editing the game\'s settings or description doesn\'t count as an update.","chartGameUpdatedMarker":"Last Updated","metricChangeVsPrevious":"{{percent}}% vs previous {{days}} days","metricNoChangeVsPrevious":"No change vs previous {{days}} days","compareAgainst":"Compare against:","comparisonCustomGamePercentiles":"All custom games","comparisonInfo":"Every chart and metric on this page is also drawn for whatever you pick here, so you can see how your game compares. All custom games shows the shaded range that the middle 60% of games fall in, with the median through it. It counts every custom game with at least 1,000 plays in the last 7 days.","comparisonSearchGames":"Search for a game","comparisonSearchFailed":"Couldn\'t search games","comparisonUnavailable":"Comparison unavailable","comparisonLegendBand":"{{label}}: top 20% to bottom 20%","comparisonLegendMedian":"Median","comparisonPercentile80":"Top 20%","comparisonPercentile50":"Median","comparisonPercentile20":"Bottom 20%","comparisonPlacementTopFifth":"Top 20%","comparisonPlacementAboveMedian":"Above median","comparisonPlacementBelowMedian":"Below median","comparisonPlacementBottomFifth":"Bottom 20%","metricVsComparison":"{{label}}: {{value}}","metricVsComparisonWithChange":"{{percent}}% vs {{label}} ({{value}})","ccuPeriod1h":"1 hour","ccuPeriod24h":"24 hours","ccuPeriod7d":"7 days","ccuPeriod30d":"30 days","chartGameBoostedMarker":"Boosted","boostTitle":"Boost","boostDuration":"{{minutes}}:{{seconds}}","boostTokensValue":"{{remaining}}/{{total}}","boostTokensLeftLabel":"Boosts left","boostTimeLeftLabel":"Time left","boostExplainer":"Show this game in the home page\'s boosted row for 10 minutes, you can use 3 boosts per 30 days.","boostRunning":"This game is in the home page\'s boosted row right now.","boostBusyOnOtherGame":"You\'re boosting another game right now. Stop that boost to boost this one instead.","boostNoTokensLeft":"You\'ve used all your boosts. Next one available in {{time}}.","boostStart":"Start Boost","boostStop":"Stop Boost","boostStartConfirmTitle":"Start boost?","boostStartConfirmSubtitle":"This spends one of your {{remaining}} remaining boosts to show this game in the home page\'s boosted row for 10 minutes.","boostStopConfirmTitle":"Stop boost?","boostStopConfirmSubtitle":"This ends the boost\'s home page visibility early. The boost it used won\'t be given back.","boostFailed":"Couldn\'t change your boost","comparisonCurrentWindow":"{{label}}, last {{days}} days","chartSessionsPerPlayerInfo":"The average number of sessions each player started over the {{days}} days up to each date. A player counts once however often they came back, so a new game climbs for its first {{days}} days before the line settles."},"persistentPlot":{"profileGone":"That no longer exists","profileAlreadyLoaded":"That is already loaded","cannotDeleteOnlyProfile":"You cannot delete your only one","nothingToReset":"There is nothing loaded to reset","loadFailedRejoin":"That could not be loaded - rejoin to try again","stillLoading":"Still loading - try again in a moment","switchingTooQuickly":"You are switching too quickly","tooManyProfiles":"You can only have {{max}} at once","nameEmpty":"That name is empty"},"skyblockGame":{"skills":"Skills","quests":"Quests","skillsIntro":"Grow your skills as you explore Skyblock.","questsIntro":"Your next steps and the journey so far.","earnXp":"Earn XP","foraging":"Foraging","combat":"Combat","mobZombie":"Zombie","mobHardenedZombie":"Hardened Zombie","mobHuntress":"Huntress","mining":"Mining","farming":"Farming","fishing":"Fishing","foragingDescription":"Gather wood and flowers to grow your Foraging skill.","combatDescription":"Defeat creatures to grow your Combat skill.","combatBonus":"+{{bonus}}% damage against mobs. Gain +{{perLevel}}% per Combat level.","miningDescription":"Break ores to grow your Mining skill.","farmingDescription":"Harvest mature crops to grow your Farming skill.","fishingDescription":"Catch fish to grow your Fishing skill.","logSource":"Logs: {{xp}} XP per block. Stripping a log with an axe pays the same.","creatureKillSource":"Defeat creatures for XP; tougher and higher-level ones give more.","noEnvironmentalXp":"Spikes and lava kills do not earn XP.","cropSource":"Freshly grown crops: {{xp}} XP per harvested block.","noYoungCropXp":"Young crops do not earn XP.","itemXpSource":"{{item}}: {{xp}} XP.","level":"Level {{level}}","lobbyLeaderboardLevel":"Level","max":"MAX","xpProgress":"{{current}} / {{target}} XP","xpGain":"+{{xp}} XP","progress":"{{current}} / {{target}}","stepsProgress":"{{current}} / {{target}} steps","completed":"Completed","trackingQuest":"Tracking this quest","updating":"Updating\u2026","pleaseWait":"Please wait\u2026","trackQuest":"Track quest","tracking":"Tracking","trackedQuest":"TRACKED QUEST","viewQuest":"View quest \u203a","current":"Current","noActiveQuests":"No active quests. More adventures await!","noCompletedQuests":"Completed quests will appear here.","completedQuest":"COMPLETED QUEST","currentQuest":"CURRENT QUEST","questsHeading":"Quests","questAvailable":"! New quest","questStartedPrefix":"New quest: ","questCompletedPrefix":"Quest complete: ","questBridgeToHubName":"Bridge to the Hub","questBridgeToHubDescription":"Craft a Maple Planks Bridge [[Maple Planks Bridge]].\\nChop maple logs, then craft planks.","questCrossToHubName":"Visit the Hub","questCrossToHubDescription":"Gather logs, craft a bridge and cross to the portal. Step through to visit the Hub.","questChopLogsName":"Collect 3 Maple Log [[Maple Log]]","questChopLogsDescription":"Chop the maple tree until you are holding 3 Maple Log [[Maple Log]].","questCraftBridgeName":"Craft a Bridge","questCraftBridgeDescription":"Use the workbench to craft Maple Planks, then a Maple Planks Bridge [[Maple Planks Bridge]].","questVisitHubName":"Enter the Hub portal","questVisitHubDescription":"Place the planks across the gap, then step through the portal.","questMeetMastersName":"Meet the Masters","questMeetMastersDescription":"Ready to meet the locals? Start with Tillie at Tillie\'s Patch, then find Timbertooth, Lorenzo and Mini, Ruby and Blubberbeard. Take each master\'s task, then come back to me!","questMeetTimbertooth":"Meet Timbertooth","questMeetLorenzoAndMini":"Meet Lorenzo and Mini","questMeetRuby":"Meet Ruby","questMeetTillie":"Meet Tillie","questMeetBlubberbeard":"Meet Blubberbeard","questMeetTimbertoothDescription":"Find Timbertooth in Timbertooth Woods in the Hub and take his first foraging task.","questMeetLorenzoAndMiniDescription":"Find Lorenzo and Mini at the Badlands in the Hub, then take Lorenzo\'s first monster-hunting task.","questMeetRubyDescription":"Find Ruby at Ruby\'s Rockpile in the Hub and take her first mining task.","questMeetTillieDescription":"Find Tillie at Tillie\'s Patch in the Hub and take her first farming task.","questMeetBlubberbeardDescription":"Find Blubberbeard at Blubberbeard\'s Shack in the Hub and take his first fishing task.","questWatchDogName":"Speak to Watch Dog","questWatchDogDescription":"Quite the welcoming party, eh? Find Watch Dog beside the orange portal. He\'ll tell you what we\'re keeping an eye on.","questFindWatchDogDescription":"Speak to Watch Dog beside the orange portal in the Hub to learn what lies beyond it.","maverickNothingToDo":"Adventure won\'t wait all day! Go on, explore. I\'ve got your back.","miniNothingToDo":"Lorenzo has a task for you. I\'ll spare you the speech about his cape. We both know who won the last bout.","watchDogOverview":"The orange portal leads to a dangerous, twisted realm. Its dungeons must be kept contained so the Hub stays safe. Stay alert in there.","questForagingLevelOneName":"Woodland Ways","questForagingLevelOneDescription":"Ah, glad you\'re here. I found this axe at the back of my cupboard. It\'s yours to keep. Bring me 10 Maple Log [[Maple Log]], and we\'ll get you started.","questForagingFirstDescription":"Chop 10 Maple Log [[Maple Log]] in my woods and bring them back to me. Take care of the woods.","questForagingFirstReminder":"Back again. You need {{remaining}} more Maple Log [[Maple Log]] for this delivery. Keep your cuts careful.","questForagingSecondReminder":"Still need {{remaining}} more Maple Log [[Maple Log]]. The Wooden Mapletwin is waiting.","questForagingFirstDelivery":"Bring Timbertooth 10 Maple Log [[Maple Log]]","questForagingFirstTurnIn":"Thank you. Clean work. Bring me 20 more Maple Log [[Maple Log]]. I\'ve a Wooden Mapletwin for you.","questForagingSecondDescription":"Chop 20 more Maple Log [[Maple Log]] in my woods. I will trade you a special axe of mine that you may find useful. Keep your cuts careful.","questForagingSecondDelivery":"Bring Timbertooth 20 more Maple Log [[Maple Log]]","questForagingCompleted":"Good work. Take this Wooden Mapletwin. It cuts Maple Log [[Maple Log]] faster, two at a time when they\'re touching. Make use of it, but mind the woods.","questCombatLevelOneName":"A Duellist\'s First Steps","questCombatLevelOneDescription":"Take my Practice Sword and face the Zombies in the Badlands! It adds a little bite to every blow. Bring me 4 Rotten Flesh [[Rotten Flesh]] as proof of your escapades.","questCombatFirstDescription":"Face the Zombies roaming the Badlands and bring me 4 Rotten Flesh [[Rotten Flesh]] as proof of your courage!","questCombatFirstReminder":"Back for an encore? Gather {{remaining}} more Rotten Flesh [[Rotten Flesh]] for this delivery. Chin up, duellist!","questCombatSecondReminder":"Your next challenge needs {{remaining}} more Rotten Flesh [[Rotten Flesh]]. A finer blade awaits your flourish!","questCombatFirstDelivery":"Bring Lorenzo 4 Rotten Flesh [[Rotten Flesh]]","questCombatFirstTurnIn":"Splendid! Thank you, brave duellist. Bring me 8 more Rotten Flesh [[Rotten Flesh]]. Keep that courage, and I\'ll find you a finer blade!","questCombatSecondDescription":"Bring me 8 more Rotten Flesh [[Rotten Flesh]] from the Badlands Zombies. A finer blade awaits your return!","questCombatSecondDelivery":"Bring Lorenzo 8 more Rotten Flesh [[Rotten Flesh]]","questCombatCompleted":"Bravo! Thank you for thinning their ranks. Take this Iron Sword [[Iron Sword]]. Now that\'s a blade worthy of your flourish!","questMiningLevelOneName":"Learning the Lode","questMiningLevelOneDescription":"Take my Coal Pickaxe and bring me 10 Coal [[Coal]]. It\'ll cut through coal a little quicker. Stubborn rock? Be more stubborn!","questMiningFirstDescription":"Mine 10 Coal Ore [[Coal Ore]] here in Ruby\'s Rockpile and bring me the Coal [[Coal]]. Show that stubborn rock who\'s boss!","questMiningFirstReminder":"Good to see you back! You need {{remaining}} more Coal [[Coal]] for this haul. Don\'t let the rocks win!","questMiningSecondReminder":"Another {{remaining}} Coal [[Coal]] and this haul\'s done, friend. That better pickaxe is waiting!","questMiningFirstDelivery":"Bring Ruby 10 Coal [[Coal]]","questMiningFirstTurnIn":"Lovely haul, thank you! Bring me 20 more Coal [[Coal]]. I\'ve got a better pickaxe for arms that won\'t quit.","questMiningSecondDescription":"Mine 20 more Coal Ore [[Coal Ore]] in Ruby\'s Rockpile and bring me the Coal [[Coal]], friend. There\'s a better pickaxe waiting for you!","questMiningSecondDelivery":"Bring Ruby 20 more Coal [[Coal]]","questMiningCompleted":"Thank you! That\'s a proper haul. This Cracked Rubellite Pickaxe [[Cracked Rubellite Pickaxe]] is yours. It swings like iron, even with that crack!","questFarmingLevelOneName":"Seeds of Success","questFarmingLevelOneDescription":"Take my hoe, dear. It harvests Wheat [[Wheat]] and Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]] a little faster. Bring me 12 Wheat [[Wheat]] when you\'re ready.","questFarmingFirstDescription":"Harvest 12 Wheat [[Wheat]] in my patch here in the hub, then bring it back to me when you\'re ready, dear.","questFarmingFirstReminder":"Welcome back, dear. Gather {{remaining}} more Wheat [[Wheat]] for this harvest. There\'s no hurry.","questFarmingSecondReminder":"Your next harvest needs {{remaining}} more Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]], dear. A hoe for harvesting rows will be waiting.","questFarmingFirstDelivery":"Bring Tillie 12 Wheat [[Wheat]]","questFarmingFirstTurnIn":"Thank you, dear. A fine first harvest. Bring me 24 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]] when you\'re ready, and I\'ll give you a hoe for harvesting whole rows in your growing garden.","questFarmingSecondDescription":"Harvest 24 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]] in my patch here in the hub, dear, then bring them to me. Take your time. A hoe for harvesting rows awaits.","questFarmingSecondDelivery":"Bring Tillie 24 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]]","questFarmingCompleted":"Thank you, dear. You\'ve tended that well. Take my Field Hoe to harvest three ripe crops in a row. May your garden keep growing.","questFishingLevelOneName":"Learning the Lines","questFishingLevelOneDescription":"Take my Old Rod and cast into water. The fish will bite a little sooner. Bring me 4 fish, matey.","questFishingFirstDescription":"Cast into the water by my shack and catch 4 fish, matey, then bring them back to me. Any fish will do!","questFishingFirstReminder":"Back aboard, matey? Catch {{remaining}} more fish for this delivery.","questFishingSecondReminder":"Another {{remaining}} fish and this delivery\'s done, matey. Then that sturdier rod is yours.","questFishingFirstDelivery":"Bring Blubberbeard 4 fish","questFishingFirstTurnIn":"A fine catch. Thank you, matey. Bring me 8 more fish. There\'s a sturdier rod waiting for patient hands.","questFishingSecondDescription":"Catch 8 more fish by my shack and bring them to me, matey. Any fish will do. A sturdier rod awaits.","questFishingSecondDelivery":"Bring Blubberbeard 8 more fish","questFishingCompleted":"Thank you, matey. Fine fishing. My Quick Rod is yours. Fish bite on it quicker than on my Old Rod.","subquestReady":"Return to {{npc}}","subquestLocked":"Complete the previous step","subquestSkipped":"Skipped","subquestCompletedPrefix":"Step complete: ","questReadyToTurnIn":"\u2713 Ready to hand in","waypointDistance":"{{distance}} m","woodyNothingToDo":"Good work takes time. Mind the woods while you\'re out there.","catnissNothingToDo":"Keep your blade sharp and your chin up. I\'ll handle the dramatic cape work.","digoryNothingToDo":"Rest those arms, friend. The rocks won\'t get any softer waiting.","gillNothingToDo":"Give yourself time to grow, dear. Even the finest harvest starts small.","blubberbeardNothingToDo":"Easy, matey. No rushing a good catch. Even an old pirate knows when to wait.","talkPrompt":"Talk","bankPrompt":"Open Bank","bankerSubtitle":"Deposit & withdraw [[Gold Coin]]","bankerApproach":"[[Gold Coin]] weighing you down? Deposit them with me, withdraw when you need them. Sensible business.","auctioneerPrompt":"Open Market","auctioneerSubtitle":"Buy & sell items","auctioneerApproach":"What\'s up dog! Buy what you need, sell what you don\'t. Let\'s get those items moving!","auctionHouseHubOnly":"Visit Up Dog in the hub to trade items.","instantBuyCategory":"Instant Buy","instantBuyDescription":"Decorative blocks for your island. Choose a quantity and buy with [[Gold Coin]] from your purse.","instantBuyPerBlock":"{{coins}} per block","instantBuySearch":"Block Search","instantBuySearchDescription":"Search by name or colour. Leave blank to show all blocks.","instantBuySearchPlaceholder":"Block name or colour...","instantBuyReset":"Reset","instantBuyResetDescription":"Clear the search and show all blocks.","instantBuyNoResults":"Try another name or colour, or search with an empty field to show all blocks.","instantBuyInventoryFull":"Inventory full. [[Gold Coin]] refunded.","instantBuyPurchased":"Bought {{amount}} blocks for {{coins}} [[Gold Coin]].","instantBuyPartial":"Inventory full. [[Gold Coin]] for the remaining blocks were refunded.","zoneIsland":"Your Island","zoneHub":"The Hub","zoneDungeons":"Dungeons","mobSkeleton":"Skeleton","mobFrostZombie":"Frost Zombie","mobFrostSkeleton":"Frost Skeleton","dungeons":"Dungeons","dungeonsIntro":"Clear each dungeon at four difficulties, against the clock.","dungeonCrumblingCryptName":"Crumbling Crypt","dungeonFrozenHollowName":"Frozen Hollow","difficultyEasy":"Easy","difficultyMedium":"Medium","difficultyHard":"Hard","difficultyInsane":"Insane","dungeonEnterPrompt":"Enter dungeon: ","dungeonStartedPrefix":"Entering: ","dungeonRoomCleared":"Room cleared!","dungeonBossPrefix":"Boss: ","dungeonBossDefeated":"Boss defeated!","bossGravewarden":"Gravewarden","bossIronGravewarden":"Iron Gravewarden","bossCorruptedGravewarden":"Corrupted Gravewarden","bossMoltenGravewarden":"Molten Gravewarden","bossFrostboundKnight":"Frostbound Knight","bossFrostboundHuntress":"Frostbound Huntress","bossFrostboundReaver":"Frostbound Reaver","bossFrostboundWarper":"Frostbound Warper","dungeonCompletedPrefix":"Dungeon complete: ","dungeonIn":"in {{time}}","dungeonNewBest":"New best time!","dungeonFailed":"Dungeon failed: ","dungeonTimedOut":"Out of time: ","dungeonCompletedBy":" completed ","dungeonOn":" on ","dungeonRooms":"Room {{current}} / {{total}}","dungeonBestTime":"Best: {{time}}","dungeonNotCompleted":"Not yet completed","dungeonCompletions":"Completed {{completions}}\xd7","dungeonNoSpace":"Every dungeon is in use right now. Try again in a moment.","dungeonStartFailed":"The dungeon could not be prepared. Try again.","dungeonsUsage":"Usage: /dungeons","travellingTo":"Travelling to ","portalTransitHeading":"Travelling to","noCurrentQuest":"No active quest","crafting":"{{emoji}}Crafting","clickToCraft":"{{emoji}}Click to craft","islandDuplicateSession":"You are already playing on another device. ","islandCloseAndRejoin":"Close it and rejoin.","islandLoadFailed":"Your island could not be loaded. ","islandPleaseRejoin":"Please rejoin.","coins":"Coins","bank":"Bank","bankSubtext":"Bank: {{amount}}","bankPurseLabel":"Purse: ","bankBalanceLabel":"Bank: ","bankDeposit":"Deposit","bankWithdraw":"Withdraw","bankDepositAmount":"\u2193 {{amount}}","bankWithdrawAmount":"\u2191 {{amount}}","bankPursePreview":"Purse: {{before}} \u2192 {{after}}","bankBalancePreview":"Bank: {{before}} \u2192 {{after}}","bankTransferMaximum":"Up to {{amount}} [[Gold Coin]]","bankTransferLimited":"Limited by remaining bank space","bankDeposited":"Deposited {{amount}} [[Gold Coin]].","bankWithdrew":"Withdrew {{amount}} [[Gold Coin]].","bankNotAnAmount":"Enter a whole number of [[Gold Coin]].","bankPurseEmpty":"Your purse is empty.","bankEmpty":"Your bank is empty.","bankFull":"Your bank is full.","bankItem_depositAll":"Deposit everything","bankItemDesc_depositAll":"Move every [[Gold Coin]] in your purse into the bank.","bankItem_depositHalf":"Deposit half","bankItemDesc_depositHalf":"Move half your purse into the bank.","bankItem_depositCustom":"Deposit an amount","bankItemDesc_depositCustom":"Move a chosen number of [[Gold Coin]] into the bank.","bankItem_withdrawAll":"Withdraw everything","bankItemDesc_withdrawAll":"Take every [[Gold Coin]] out of the bank.","bankItem_withdrawHalf":"Withdraw half","bankItemDesc_withdrawHalf":"Take half your bank balance out.","bankItem_withdrawCustom":"Withdraw an amount","bankItemDesc_withdrawCustom":"Take a chosen number of [[Gold Coin]] out of the bank.","skillLevelUp":"LEVEL {{to}}!","skillsUsage":"Usage: /skills","inventoryFull":"Your inventory is full!","exploration":"Exploration","explorationDescription":"Discover zones and landmarks to grow your exploration skill.","explorationZoneSource":"New zone: {{xp}} XP","explorationLandmarkSource":"New landmark: {{xp}} XP","landmarkDiscovered":"LANDMARK DISCOVERED","map":"Map","mapLocal":"Local","mapWorld":"World","mapVisitFirst":"Visit here first to fast travel.","mapAlreadyHere":"You\'re already here.","mapLandmarkTravelDisabled":"Fast travel to this landmark isn\'t available yet.","mapDungeonTravelDisabled":"Finish or leave your dungeon first.","mapCombatTravelDisabled":"Wait 10 seconds after combat to fast travel.","mapLoadingTravelDisabled":"Wait until your island has loaded.","mapDeadTravelDisabled":"Respawn before fast travelling.","mapTravelPending":"You\'re already preparing to travel.","mapTravelUnsafe":"There\'s no safe place to arrive here.","mapInvalidDestination":"Choose a destination on your map.","mapWrongZone":"Visit this zone before travelling to its landmarks.","mapUsage":"Use /map to choose where to explore.","mapTravelling":"Preparing to travel\u2026","mapTravelTimeout":"Travel didn\'t start. Try again.","mapUnknown":"???","mapDiscovered":"{{current}} / {{total}} discovered","mapNoLandmarks":"No landmarks here yet.","mapSchematic":"Zone map","mapYouAreHere":"You are here","mapTravelHint":"Select a discovered place to travel there.","mapZoomIn":"Zoom in","mapZoomOut":"Zoom out","mapHubReference":"The Hub","mapIslandReference":"Starter island reference","mapDungeonsReference":"Dungeon plaza","mapInsideDungeon":"Inside a dungeon","compassEnemy":"Enemy","compassNpc":"NPC","compassUnknown":"Undiscovered landmark","landmarkBank":"Bling Bank","landmarkAuction":"Up Dog\'s Auction","mapLandmarkAuction":"Up Dog\'s\\nAuction","lootInventoryFull":"Inventory full!","landmarkForest":"Timbertooth Woods","landmarkCastle":"The Badlands","landmarkMines":"Ruby\'s Rockpile","landmarkFarm":"Tillie\'s Patch","landmarkFishing":"Blubberbeard\'s Shack","questMeetMaverickOnIslandName":"Meet Maverick at Your Island","questMeetMaverickOnIslandDescription":"Your island could use a little adventure too! Meet me back there when you\'re ready.","questReturnToIslandDescription":"Return to your island and speak to me beside the portal.","questMapleGroveName":"Maple Grove","questMapleGroveDescription":"Your island could use a little shade! Grow 5 Maple trees.","questCraftMapleSaplingName":"Craft a Maple Sapling [[Maple Sapling]]","questCraftMapleSaplingDescription":"At the Workbench [[Workbench]] on your island, combine 1 Maple Log [[Maple Log]] and 1 Maple Leaves [[Maple Leaves]] to make a Maple Sapling [[Maple Sapling]]. Break the leaves on a Maple tree to collect Maple Leaves [[Maple Leaves]].","questGrowMapleTreesName":"Grow 5 Maple Trees","questGrowMapleTreesDescription":"Plant new Maple Sapling [[Maple Sapling]] on your island and stay there while 5 of them grow into trees.","questCropCirclesName":"Crop Circles","questCropCirclesDescription":"Try a little garden magic! Plant 9 Wheat Seeds [[Wheat Seeds]] in a 3 by 3 square on flat ground on your island, and stick around while they all grow. Need seeds? Harvest Wheat [[Wheat]] at Tillie\'s Patch in the Hub!","questGrowWheatSquareDescription":"Plant 9 Wheat Seeds [[Wheat Seeds]] in a 3 by 3 square on flat ground on your island, then stay on your island until all 9 are fully grown. Harvesting Wheat [[Wheat]] at Tillie\'s Patch in the Hub gives you seeds.","questSpeakToLorenzoName":"Speak to Lorenzo","questSpeakToLorenzoDescription":"Lorenzo says you\'ve mastered his challenges. Go ask him about a sparring partner for your island!","questFindLorenzoDescription":"Find Lorenzo in the Hub and ask him about a sparring partner.","questSparringPartnerName":"Bring Lorenzo 4 Rotten Brains","questSparringPartnerDescription":"A duellist needs a worthy target! Bring me 4 Rotten Brains [[Rotten Brain]], and I\'ll reward you with a Combat Dummy.","questSparringPartnerDelivery":"Bring Lorenzo 4 Rotten Brains [[Rotten Brain]]","questSparringPartnerDeliveryDescription":"Gather 4 Rotten Brains [[Rotten Brain]] and bring them to me in the Hub to claim your Combat Dummy.","questSparringPartnerReminder":"Still waiting on {{remaining}} Rotten Brains [[Rotten Brain]]. Then the Combat Dummy is yours!","questSparringPartnerCompleted":"Splendid! Take this Combat Dummy. Maverick has an eye for training grounds - meet him on your island.","questPunchingBagName":"Sparring Partner","questPunchingBagDescription":"Meet me on your island. I know the perfect place for that Combat Dummy!","questPlaceCombatDummyName":"Place the Combat Dummy","questPlaceCombatDummyDescription":"Now that is a sparring partner! Place the Combat Dummy anywhere on your island.","maverickRescue":"Got you! Even adventurers need a lift. Through the portal\u2014the Hub awaits!","miniWantsWoodHelmet":"We start at the top, and that helmet is wrong. Put on a Wood Helmet [[Wood Helmet]] and come back to me.","miniWantsIronHelmet":"We start at the top, and that helmet is wrong. Put on an Iron Helmet [[Iron Helmet]] and come back to me.","miniWantsWoodChestplate":"Helmet\'s right. The chestplate isn\'t. Swap it for a Wood Chestplate [[Wood Chestplate]].","miniWantsIronChestplate":"Helmet\'s right. The chestplate isn\'t. Swap it for an Iron Chestplate [[Iron Chestplate]].","miniWantsWoodGauntlets":"Head and chest are sorted. Your hands aren\'t. Wear Wood Gauntlets [[Wood Gauntlets]].","miniWantsIronGauntlets":"Head and chest are sorted. Your hands aren\'t. Wear Iron Gauntlets [[Iron Gauntlets]].","miniWantsWoodLeggings":"Good so far. The leggings are the problem. Wear Wood Leggings [[Wood Leggings]].","miniWantsIronLeggings":"Good so far. The leggings are the problem. Wear Iron Leggings [[Iron Leggings]].","miniWantsWoodBoots":"Everything but the boots. Wear Wood Boots [[Wood Boots]] and we\'re finished.","miniWantsIronBoots":"Everything but the boots. Wear Iron Boots [[Iron Boots]] and we\'re finished.","miniArmourApproved":"Every piece as I\'d have it. Here\'s a chestplate with enough flourish to make Lorenzo jealous.","questNightWatchName":"The Night Watch","questNightWatchDescription":"Night patrol needs eyes that work in the dark. Take this Frost Shard [[Frost Shard]], recovered on duty, and make me a Night Vision Soup [[Night Vision Soup]].","questNightWatchCarrotsName":"Pick 2 Carrots","questNightWatchCarrots":"Pick 2 Carrots [[Carrot]] at Tillie\'s Patch, the farm in the hub. Good eyes start with good food.","questNightWatchBowlName":"Craft a Bowl [[Bowl]]","questNightWatchBowl":"Craft a Bowl [[Bowl]] from 3 Maple Wood Planks [[Maple Wood Planks]].","questNightWatchCraftName":"Craft Night Vision Soup [[Night Vision Soup]]","questNightWatchCraft":"Combine 2 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]], the Frost Shard [[Frost Shard]] and the Bowl [[Bowl]] to make the Night Vision Soup [[Night Vision Soup]]. Lost the shard? Report to me at the dungeon portal in the hub and I\'ll issue another.","questNightWatchDelivery":"Bring Watch Dog 1 Night Vision Soup [[Night Vision Soup]]","questNightWatchDeliver":"Bring the Night Vision Soup [[Night Vision Soup]] to me at the dungeon portal in the hub. If it\'s eaten or gone, report to me for a new Frost Shard [[Frost Shard]].","questNightWatchReminder":"{{remaining}} more Night Vision Soup [[Night Vision Soup]] and the patrol is equipped. Do it properly.","questNightWatchCompleted":"Patrol-ready. Wear this chestplate \u2014 it has kept three heads safe for years, and it will keep you standing longer.","questNightWatchUnavailableHint":"Not now. Come back after dark, when the work is real. Bring 2 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]] from Tillie\'s Patch.","questNightWatchPreparingHint":"Give me a moment. I\'m preparing the patrol.","questNightWatchNudge":"Watch Dog is on duty at the dungeon portal. Go and see him.","questFurRunName":"Spare Lining","questFurRunDescription":"Tillie needs fur. My patrol coat has spare lining, and I keep the trimmings. Bring me 12 Carrots [[Carrot]] for the three of us and it\'s yours.","questFurRunDelivery":"Bring Watch Dog 12 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]]","questFurRunErrandDescription":"Pull 12 Carrots [[Carrot]] at Tillie\'s Patch, the farm in the hub. Bring them to me at the dungeon portal and the fur is yours.","questFurRunReminder":"Not yet. {{remaining}} more Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]], then we trade.","questFurRunCompleted":"Fair trade. Take the fur to Tillie, and stay warm out there.","questAncientWoodlandName":"The Ancient Woodland","questAncientWoodlandDescription":"Some of these maples still hold ancient wood. Look for logs that sparkle, low on the trunk. Bring me 16 Ancient Maple Log [[Ancient Maple Log]].","questAncientWoodlandNotYet":"Not yet. Let the grove settle.","questAncientWoodlandNudge":"Timbertooth has work in the grove. Go and see him.","questAncientWoodlandErrandDescription":"Chop sparkling logs in Timbertooth Woods, behind me. Only you can see the sparkles. None near you? Try other trees.","questAncientWoodlandReminder":"{{remaining}} more Ancient Maple Log [[Ancient Maple Log]]. Look low on the trunks for sparkles.","questAncientWoodlandCompleted":"Good. Old wood, well cut. These leggings are made from it. Light on the feet.","questAncientWoodlandDelivery":"Bring Timbertooth 16 Ancient Maple Log [[Ancient Maple Log]]","questAllGearedUpName":"All Geared Up","questAllGearedUpDescription":"Mini has strong opinions about armour. Put on a full set and let him look you over.","questAllGearedUpInspection":"Wear 5 armour pieces that pass Mini\'s inspection","questAllGearedUpErrand":"Dress for the duel! Wear a helmet, chestplate, gauntlets, leggings and boots, then show Mini. ","questAllGearedUpUnavailableHint":"A moment, my friend \u2014 Mini is still polishing his horns. Return shortly.","questAllGearedUpNudge":"Lorenzo says Mini is ready to inspect your armour, over at The Badlands.","questHardenedEvidenceName":"A Hardened Hunch","questHardenedEvidenceDescription":"I\'ve had troubling reports from the far end of The Badlands. Travellers say the Zombies there have skin like rock and fists that pound the ground hard enough to throw a person off their feet. Worse, they\'ve made a camp. Zombies wander; they don\'t settle. A wise hunter learns his quarry before he draws his blade. Bring me proof, duellist!","questHardenedEvidenceErrand":"Find the Hardened Zombies camped at the far end of The Badlands and take 3 Hardened Hearts from them. Step out of the ring when they pound the ground!","questHardenedEvidenceCollect":"Defeat Hardened Zombies for 3 Hardened Hearts","questHardenedEvidenceDelivery":"Bring Lorenzo 3 Hardened Hearts","questHardenedEvidenceHandInDescription":"Bring those Hardened Hearts back to me, duellist. I must see them with my own eyes!","questHardenedEvidenceReminder":"{{remaining}} more of those Hardened Hearts, duellist. If the travellers are right, I\'d rather know sooner than later.","questHardenedEvidenceCompleted":"Hard as rock, and still beating... The travellers were right. No ordinary Zombie grows a heart like this. Something out there is changing them, and I mean to find out what. Mini won\'t believe a word of it. You\'ve done the Hub a real service, duellist.","questHardenedResearchName":"Know Your Quarry","questHardenedResearchDescription":"Those Hardened Hearts have kept me up all night, duellist. Skin like rock, fists like hammers... Whatever hardens those Zombies, I mean to understand it, and perhaps to borrow it. That calls for research! Bring me samples from the Hardened Zombies, and from ordinary Zombies to compare. Do this, and I\'ll forge you something special.","questHardenedResearchIronFragmentCollect":"Defeat Hardened Zombies for 6 Iron Fragments [[Iron Fragment]]","questHardenedResearchIronFragmentDelivery":"Bring Lorenzo 6 Iron Fragments [[Iron Fragment]]","questHardenedResearchIronFragmentGather":"Defeat Hardened Zombies at the far end of The Badlands for 6 Iron Fragments [[Iron Fragment]]. They flake off that rock-hard skin, and no other Zombie carries them.","questHardenedResearchIronFragmentDeliver":"Bring the 6 Iron Fragments [[Iron Fragment]] back to me for study.","questHardenedResearchIronFragmentReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Iron Fragment [[Iron Fragment]]. Only the Hardened Zombies drop them, duellist.","questHardenedResearchIronFragmentCompleted":"Iron, flaked straight off their skin! But iron alone doesn\'t walk about. Something more is at work here.","questHardenedResearchRottenBrainCollect":"Collect 3 Rotten Brains [[Rotten Brain]]","questHardenedResearchRottenBrainDelivery":"Bring Lorenzo 3 Rotten Brains [[Rotten Brain]]","questHardenedResearchRottenBrainGather":"Defeat Zombies in The Badlands for 3 Rotten Brains [[Rotten Brain]]. Any Zombie will do, though Hardened Zombies drop them more often.","questHardenedResearchRottenBrainDeliver":"Bring the 3 Rotten Brains [[Rotten Brain]] back to me. Whatever you do, don\'t eat them!","questHardenedResearchRottenBrainReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Rotten Brain [[Rotten Brain]]. Any Zombie will do.","questHardenedResearchRottenBrainCompleted":"Brains! Let\'s see what they\'ve been thinking.","questHardenedResearchRottenFleshCollect":"Collect 16 Rotten Flesh [[Rotten Flesh]]","questHardenedResearchRottenFleshDelivery":"Bring Lorenzo 16 Rotten Flesh [[Rotten Flesh]]","questHardenedResearchRottenFleshGather":"Defeat Zombies in The Badlands for 16 Rotten Flesh [[Rotten Flesh]], hardened or not. I need plenty to compare.","questHardenedResearchRottenFleshDeliver":"Bring the 16 Rotten Flesh [[Rotten Flesh]] back to me. Hold your nose!","questHardenedResearchRottenFleshReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Rotten Flesh [[Rotten Flesh]], duellist. Hardened or not, any Zombie will do.","questHardenedResearchRottenFleshCompleted":"Every sample accounted for! Between these and those Hardened Hearts, I\'ve learned the magic that hardens them, and worked it into good iron. Behold, the Hardened Sword! Land ten good strikes, and the next hits three times as hard.","lorenzoTripleStrikeReady":"Triple strike ready!","lorenzoSwordTripleStrike":"Triple strike!","questCompressionObsessionName":"Compression Obsession","questCompressionObsessionDescription":"I\'ve a daft idea: squash stone until it squeaks. Bring me 4 Compressed Messy Stone [[Compressed Messy Stone]] and we\'ll see if it works.","questCompressionFirstDescription":"Squash 9 Messy Stone [[Messy Stone]] into 1 Compressed Messy Stone [[Compressed Messy Stone]] at a Workbench [[Workbench]] on your island. Bring 4 of them back to me at Ruby\'s Rockpile, by the mines.","questCompressionFirstReminder":"{{remaining}} more Compressed Messy Stone [[Compressed Messy Stone]] and we\'re away. The rock is losing, friend!","questCompressionFirstDelivery":"Bring Ruby 4 Compressed Messy Stone [[Compressed Messy Stone]]","questCompressionFirstTurnIn":"Ha, heavier than it looks! Now squash those together: 2 Extra Compressed Messy Stone [[Extra Compressed Messy Stone]], please.","questCompressionSecondDescription":"Nine Compressed make one Extra Compressed at your island Workbench [[Workbench]]. Carry 2 down to me at Ruby\'s Rockpile, and mind your back.","questCompressionSecondReminder":"Another {{remaining}} Extra Compressed Messy Stone [[Extra Compressed Messy Stone]] to go. Stubborn rock? Be more stubborn!","questCompressionSecondDelivery":"Bring Ruby 2 Extra Compressed Messy Stone [[Extra Compressed Messy Stone]]","questCompressionSecondTurnIn":"Grand! One more squeeze, then. A single Super Compressed Messy Stone [[Super Compressed Messy Stone]] is all I ask.","questCompressionThirdDescription":"Nine Extra Compressed make one Super Compressed at your island Workbench [[Workbench]]. Just the one, brought down to me at Ruby\'s Rockpile, and I\'ll be happy.","questCompressionThirdReminder":"Still {{remaining}} Super Compressed Messy Stone [[Super Compressed Messy Stone]] short. The stone isn\'t going anywhere.","questCompressionThirdDelivery":"Bring Ruby 1 Super Compressed Messy Stone [[Super Compressed Messy Stone]]","questCompressionCompleted":"Would you look at that! Take this fool\'s gold pickaxe \u2014 worth nothing, smashes stone like nothing else, and now and then it digs up a better ore than the one you hit.","questCompressionUnavailableHint":"Give me a moment to clear my workbench, friend. Come back shortly.","questCompressionAvailableNudge":"Ruby has a daft idea about squashing stone. Go and see her at Ruby\'s Rockpile, by the mines.","questFlashFreezeName":"Flash Freeze","questFlashFreezeDescription":"A cold snap is coming, dear, and my old bones feel it. Perhaps you can help me save my crops. Speak to Watch Dog. He may be willing to part with some of his fur, so I can stitch you something warm.","questFlashFreezeNotYet":"Rest a while first, dear. I\'ll have something for you shortly.","questFlashFreezeNudge":"Tillie has something for you, dear. Come and see her when you have a moment.","questFlashFreezeFur":"Bring Tillie 3 Fur [[Fur]]","questFlashFreezeFurDescription":"Watch Dog keeps spare fur, dear, and he stands guard at the dungeon portal in the hub. Ask him nicely and bring me 3.","questFlashFreezeFurReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Fur [[Fur]], dear. Come and see me if you lose it; Watch Dog left me a little spare.","questFlashFreezeFurTurnIn":"Lovely and soft, dear. Now bring me 3 Iron Bar [[Iron Bar]] and I\'ll stitch you a Worn Fur Chestplate.","questFlashFreezeIron":"Bring Tillie 3 Iron Bar [[Iron Bar]]","questFlashFreezeIronDescription":"Bring me 3 Iron Bar [[Iron Bar]], dear. Mine Iron Ore [[Iron Ore]] at Ruby\'s Rockpile with a Stone Pickaxe [[Stone Pickaxe]] or better, then smelt the Raw Iron [[Raw Iron]] in a Furnace [[Furnace]].","questFlashFreezeIronReminder":"Just {{remaining}} more Iron Bar [[Iron Bar]], dear, and your Worn Fur Chestplate is ready.","questFlashFreezeIronTurnIn":"Here you are, dear: a Worn Fur Chestplate. Put it on, then harvest the frosty Wheat [[Wheat]] in my patch.","questFlashFreezeHarvest":"Harvest 9 frosty Wheat [[Wheat]] while wearing the Worn Fur Chestplate","questFlashFreezeHarvestDescription":"Frost is settling on the Wheat [[Wheat]] by the west fence of my patch, here in the hub. Wear the Worn Fur Chestplate and harvest 9 frosty Wheat [[Wheat]]. If you lose the chestplate, come back and I\'ll stitch you another.","questFlashFreezeDelivery":"Bring Tillie 9 Wheat [[Wheat]]","questFlashFreezeDeliverDescription":"Bring those 9 Wheat [[Wheat]] back to me at Tillie\'s Patch, dear, and we\'ll see what the frost spared.","questFlashFreezeReminder":"Take your time, dear. I still need {{remaining}} more Wheat [[Wheat]] from that frosted patch.","questFlashFreezeCompleted":"Thank you, dear. Saved from the frost, every one. That Worn Fur Chestplate is yours to keep. One more harvest, dear, and we\'ll be ready for Manor Farm.","subquestReadyNoNpc":"Return to the quest giver","farmingResourceUnavailable":"Unavailable","farmingRabbitUnavailable":"No carrots to spare just now. Let me have a little quiet, please.","farmingStag1Unavailable":"No golden slices are available right now.","farmingStag2Unavailable":"No golden slices are available right now.","farmingTraderTradeReady":"Trade 4 Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]] for 1 Truffle [[Truffle]]","zoneFarming1":"Manor Farm","mapFarming1Reference":"Manor Farm","landmarkLastCrumb":"Hog\'s Gut Inn","landmarkSunstepGardens":"Stagstep Gardens","landmarkRootveilPatch":"Goldenroot Burrow","landmarkHushgrove":"Meloncloak Grove","landmarkSnoutmeadow":"Snoutmeadow","farmingCowFeed":"Feed: 1 Wheat [[Wheat]] + 1 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]]","farmingFeedEating":"Eating... {{seconds}}s","farmingStagFeed":"Feed: 4 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]]","farmingRabbitFeed":"Trade: 1 Carrot [[Carrot]]","farmingCowHungry":"Feed a Cow 1 Wheat [[Wheat]] and 1 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]] for Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]].","farmingCowInventoryFull":"Make room in your inventory for the milk.","farmingChefIdle":"A quiet kitchen. Best enjoy it while it lasts.","farmingChefGreeting":"Oh, good! Another pair of hands.","farmingChefInventoryFull":"Your bags are full! Make room and I\'ll hand this over.","farmingChefIntroduction":"Tillie sent you? Thank goodness. The Gravy Court eats everything I cook, and if the plates run dry they\'ll wreck the inn. First things first: the pantry.","guardianHit":"Guardian hit! Keep back!","farmingPortalGuardianBlocked":"Halt. Passage requires Tillie\'s approval and a paid toll. Speak to me beside the portal.","portalGuardianIdle":"I report to Watch Dog. Passage rules apply equally to everyone.","portalGuardianGreeting":"State your business.","portalGuardianInventoryFull":"Make room in your inventory before proceeding.","questPortalTollName":"The Price of Passage","questPortalTollDescription":"Tillie\'s approval is recorded. Pay the 5,000 [[Gold Coin]] toll to open the portal to Manor Farm.","questPortalTollPayment":"Pay Portal Guardian 5,000 [[Gold Coin]]","questPortalTollPaymentDescription":"Speak to Portal Guardian beside the grey portal in the hub to pay 5,000 [[Gold Coin]] from your purse. Sell spare resources at the hub\'s Market to earn more.","questPortalTollReminder":"The toll is 5,000 [[Gold Coin]]. Your purse needs {{remaining}} more [[Gold Coin]]. Sell spare resources at the Market, then return.","questPortalTollPaid":"Payment recorded. Go through the yellow portal to Manor Farm.","farmingBaronIdle":"The table is ready. Why is my next course not? Such fine plates. It would be a shame if they broke.","farmingTraderIdle":"Fresh milk for fresh truffles. A fair bargain.","farmingTraderTrade":"Four Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]] for one Truffle [[Truffle]]. Bling Bling\'s family; that greedy Gravy Court isn\'t.","farmingTraderMissingMilk":"Bring 4 Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]] for 1 Truffle [[Truffle]].","farmingTraderFeedCow":"No milk? Feed a cow 1 Wheat [[Wheat]] and 1 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]] and it pays you a Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]]. That\'s a fairer bargain than the Gravy Court offers.","farmingTraderInventoryFull":"Make room for your Truffle [[Truffle]] before we trade.","farmingTraderQuestTrade":"One Truffle [[Truffle]], as promised. Take it to Clatter before the Gravy Court starts grumbling.","questFinalHarvestName":"One Final Harvest","questFinalHarvestDescription":"One final harvest from this patch before we head to Manor Farm, dear. Bring me a full stack of Wheat [[Wheat]] and a full stack of Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]]: 999 of each.","questFinalHarvestWheatCollect":"Collect 999 Wheat [[Wheat]]","questFinalHarvestWheatDelivery":"Bring Tillie 999 Wheat [[Wheat]]","questFinalHarvestWheatGather":"Harvest 999 Wheat [[Wheat]] at Tillie\'s Patch in the hub.","questFinalHarvestWheatDeliver":"Bring 999 Wheat [[Wheat]] to Tillie beside her patch in the hub.","questFinalHarvestWheatReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} Wheat [[Wheat]], dear.","questFinalHarvestWheatCompleted":"Lovely Wheat [[Wheat]], dear. That will keep the store well stocked.","questFinalHarvestPotatoesCollect":"Collect 999 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]]","questFinalHarvestPotatoesDelivery":"Bring Tillie 999 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]]","questFinalHarvestPotatoesGather":"Harvest 999 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]] at Tillie\'s Patch in the hub.","questFinalHarvestPotatoesDeliver":"Bring 999 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]] to Tillie beside her patch in the hub.","questFinalHarvestPotatoesReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]], dear.","questFinalHarvestPotatoesCompleted":"A fine crop, dear. Here\'s some gold towards the journey. Go see Up Dog at the Market; he can help you earn the rest of the portal toll.","questFarmingTableName":"A Table in Trouble","questFarmingTableDescription":"Manor Farm has a 5,000 [[Gold Coin]] portal toll, dear. Visit Up Dog at the hub\'s Market first; he can help you sell your spare harvest.","questFarmingTableMarket":"Visit Up Dog at the Market in the hub","questFarmingTableMarketDescription":"Visit Up Dog at the hub\'s Market. He\'ll show you how to sell spare resources for [[Gold Coin]] towards the portal toll.","questFarmingTableMarketIntroduction":"Welcome to the Market! Use Instant Sell to turn spare resources into [[Gold Coin]], or trade with other players. Talk to me again to open the Market and earn your 5,000 [[Gold Coin]] toll.","questFarmingTablePortal":"Use the yellow portal to Manor Farm","questFarmingTablePortalDescription":"Go through the yellow portal beside Tillie\'s Patch, dear. It leads to Manor Farm.","questFarmingTableChef":"Speak to Clatter at Hog\'s Gut Inn","questFarmingTableChefDescription":"Find Clatter in the kitchen of Hog\'s Gut Inn in Manor Farm, dear. Tell him Tillie sent you.","questFarmingPigsMilk":"Collect 4 Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]]","questFarmingPigsMilkDescription":"Feed the Cows in Snoutmeadow 1 Wheat [[Wheat]] and 1 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]] for each Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]]. Collect 4. Wheat [[Wheat]] grows in the hub\'s fields.","questFarmingPigsTrade":"Trade 4 Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]] for 1 Truffle [[Truffle]]","questFarmingPigsTradeDescription":"Take 4 Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]] to Truff in Snoutmeadow. Interact to exchange the milk for 1 Truffle [[Truffle]], then bring it to me.","questFarmingPantryName":"Stock the Pantry","questFarmingPantryDescription":"The Gravy Court ate my pantry bare! Fill it before they get restless: 100 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]], 100 Carrot [[Carrot]], 50 Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]] and 100 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]].","questFarmingPantryWatermelonCollect":"Collect 100 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]]","questFarmingPantryWatermelonDelivery":"Bring Clatter 100 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]]","questFarmingPantryWatermelonGather":"Harvest ripe Watermelon [[Watermelon]] at Stagstep Gardens until you have 100 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]].","questFarmingPantryWatermelonDeliver":"Bring 100 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingPantryWatermelonReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]]. Bring them to me at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingPantryWatermelonCompleted":"Watermelon [[Watermelon]]\'s in! The whole pantry smells like summer.","questFarmingPantryCarrotCollect":"Collect 100 Carrot [[Carrot]]","questFarmingPantryCarrotDelivery":"Bring Clatter 100 Carrot [[Carrot]]","questFarmingPantryCarrotGather":"Harvest fully grown Carrot [[Carrot]] at Goldenroot Burrow until you have 100 Carrot [[Carrot]].","questFarmingPantryCarrotDeliver":"Bring 100 Carrot [[Carrot]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingPantryCarrotReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Carrot [[Carrot]]. Bring them to me at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingPantryCarrotCompleted":"Lovely crunchy carrots. Straight onto the shelf they go.","questFarmingPantryMelonCollect":"Collect 100 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]]","questFarmingPantryMelonDelivery":"Bring Clatter 100 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]]","questFarmingPantryMelonGather":"Harvest ripe Melon [[Melon]] at Meloncloak Grove until you have 100 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]].","questFarmingPantryMelonDeliver":"Bring 100 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingPantryMelonReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]]. Bring them to me at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingPantryMelonCompleted":"Melon [[Melon]], at last! The cold store is filling up nicely.","questFarmingPantryMilkCollect":"Collect 50 Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]]","questFarmingPantryMilkDelivery":"Bring Clatter 50 Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]]","questFarmingPantryMilkGather":"Feed the Cows in Snoutmeadow 1 Wheat [[Wheat]] and 1 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]] for each Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]] until you have 50. Wheat [[Wheat]] grows in the hub\'s fields.","questFarmingPantryMilkDeliver":"Bring 50 Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingPantryMilkReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]]. Bring it to me at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingPantryMilkCompleted":"Fresh milk for the custards. Thank you, truly!","questFarmingHigherName":"A Higher Standard","questFarmingHigherDescription":"Napoleon wants fruit from the highest branch. Bring me 1 Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]].","questFarmingHigherCollect":"Collect 1 Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]]","questFarmingHigherDelivery":"Bring Clatter 1 Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]]","questFarmingHigherGather":"Harvest Watermelon [[Watermelon]] at Stagstep Gardens. Eat a Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]] for Jump Boost, then jump up to a Gold Watermelon Stag and feed it 4 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]] for 1 Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]].","questFarmingHigherDeliver":"Bring 1 Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingHigherReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]]. Bring them to me at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingHigherCompleted":"A golden first course! Take these Watermelon Seeds [[Watermelon Seeds]] and grow your own jumping snacks.","questFarmingRootsName":"Below the Roots","questFarmingRootsDescription":"Now they want carrots with a golden shine. Bring me 1 Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]].","questFarmingRootsCollect":"Collect 1 Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]]","questFarmingRootsDelivery":"Bring Clatter 1 Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]]","questFarmingRootsGather":"Eat a Carrot [[Carrot]] in Goldenroot Burrow for X-Ray Vision and look for Lady Proudfeet through the burrow walls. Knock on her door, then go in and trade her 1 Carrot [[Carrot]] for 1 Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]].","questFarmingRootsDeliver":"Bring 1 Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingRootsReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]]. Bring them to me at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingRootsCompleted":"A carrot fit for that fussy table. These Carrot Seeds [[Carrot Seeds]] will help you find things at home, too.","questFarmingQuietName":"Quiet Picking","questFarmingQuietDescription":"The next course is guarded, naturally. Bring me 2 Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]].","questFarmingQuietCollect":"Collect 2 Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]]","questFarmingQuietDelivery":"Bring Clatter 2 Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]]","questFarmingQuietGather":"Eat a Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]] at Meloncloak Grove to turn invisible. Slip past the guards and pick up 2 Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]].","questFarmingQuietDeliver":"Bring 2 Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingQuietReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]]. Bring them to me at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingQuietCompleted":"Two golden slices, and barely a peep! Take these Melon Seeds [[Melon Seeds]] for your own garden.","questFarmingPigsName":"The Pig\'s Price","questFarmingPigsDescription":"Napoleon wants a Truffle [[Truffle]] on his plate. Truff will swap one for 4 Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]]. Start with the cows in Snoutmeadow.","questFarmingPigsCollect":"Collect 1 Truffle [[Truffle]]","questFarmingPigsDelivery":"Bring Clatter 1 Truffle [[Truffle]]","questFarmingPigsGather":"Collect 1 Truffle [[Truffle]] from Truff in Snoutmeadow. Each trade costs 4 Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]]; feed the nearby Cows for more milk if needed.","questFarmingPigsDeliver":"Bring 1 Truffle [[Truffle]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingPigsReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Truffle [[Truffle]]. Bring them to me at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingPigsCompleted":"A fine Truffle [[Truffle]]! Keep this Truffle Oil [[Truffle Oil]]. A taste puts a bounce in your step.","questFarmingHelpingName":"Another Helping","questFarmingHelpingDescription":"It\'s not the feast yet, just a plate of everything to stop them smashing the crockery. Bring me 1 Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]], 1 Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]], 2 Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]] and 1 Truffle [[Truffle]].","questFarmingHelpingCollect":"Collect 1 Truffle [[Truffle]]","questFarmingHelpingDelivery":"Bring Clatter 1 Truffle [[Truffle]]","questFarmingHelpingGather":"Get 1 Truffle [[Truffle]] from Truff in Snoutmeadow. Trade him 4 Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]] from feeding the nearby Cows.","questFarmingHelpingDeliver":"Bring 1 Truffle [[Truffle]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingHelpingReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Truffle [[Truffle]]. Bring them to me at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingHelpingCompleted":"That should keep them chewing. Take these seeds, and listen: Napoleon is already calling for more. Talk to me again when you\'re ready.","questFarmingHelpingWatermelonCollect":"Collect 1 Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]]","questFarmingHelpingWatermelonDelivery":"Bring Clatter 1 Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]]","questFarmingHelpingWatermelonGather":"Cut 5 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]] at Stagstep Gardens. Eat one to jump up to a Gold Watermelon Stag, then feed it the other 4 for 1 Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]].","questFarmingHelpingWatermelonDeliver":"Bring 1 Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]] to Clatter at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingHelpingWatermelonReminder":"Bring me {{remaining}} more Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]] at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingHelpingWatermelonCompleted":"The golden fruit is in. I\'ll keep it safe in the kitchen.","questFarmingHelpingCarrotCollect":"Collect 1 Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]]","questFarmingHelpingCarrotDelivery":"Bring Clatter 1 Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]]","questFarmingHelpingCarrotGather":"Lady Proudfeet has moved burrows. Eat a Carrot [[Carrot]] in Goldenroot Burrow to spot her through the walls, knock on her door, then go in and trade her 1 Carrot [[Carrot]] for 1 Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]].","questFarmingHelpingCarrotDeliver":"Bring 1 Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]] to Clatter at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingHelpingCarrotReminder":"Bring me {{remaining}} more Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]] at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingHelpingCarrotCompleted":"That\'s the golden carrot. This course is coming together.","questFarmingHelpingMelonCollect":"Collect 2 Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]]","questFarmingHelpingMelonDelivery":"Bring Clatter 2 Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]]","questFarmingHelpingMelonGather":"Eat a Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]] and slip past the guards at Meloncloak Grove. Pick up 2 Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]] for the table.","questFarmingHelpingMelonDeliver":"Bring 2 Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]] to Clatter at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingHelpingMelonReminder":"Bring me {{remaining}} more Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]] at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingHelpingMelonCompleted":"Two golden melon slices. Into the bowl they go.","farmingGuest1Idle":"Surely there is a larger plate.","farmingGuest2Idle":"Gold garnish. On everything.","farmingGuest3Idle":"I ordered the finest. Twice.","farmingGuest4Idle":"Napoleon has more than me.","farmingGuest5Idle":"Snuffle. Oink.","farmingGuest6Idle":"A feast should never end.","farmingStag1Fed":"The stag munches the slices and shares a Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]].","farmingStag1Eating":"The stag is still munching.","farmingStag1Hungry":"The stag sniffs your hands. It shares a Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]] for 4 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]].","farmingStag1InventoryFull":"Make some room in your inventory first.","farmingStag2Fed":"The stag munches the slices and shares a Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]].","farmingStag2Eating":"The stag is still munching.","farmingStag2Hungry":"The stag sniffs your hands. It shares a Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]] for 4 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]].","farmingStag2InventoryFull":"Make some room in your inventory first.","farmingRabbitFed":"A Carrot [[Carrot]] for me? How thoughtful, dear. Here, a Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]] for your trouble.","farmingRabbitEating":"Manners, dear. Let me finish this one first.","farmingRabbitHungry":"Hmph. A Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]] costs one Carrot [[Carrot]], dear. Bring one and we\'ll trade.","farmingRabbitInventoryFull":"Those bags are full, dear. Make room; I\'ll keep your carrot safe.","farmingTillieRabbitHintBurrows":"Looking for Lady Proudfeet, dear? She lives in the burrows around this carrot patch, behind their little doors.","farmingTillieRabbitHintCarrot":"You won\'t spot her with your eyes alone. Eat a Carrot [[Carrot]], and you\'ll see right through the earth for a little while.","farmingTillieRabbitHintKnock":"Once you can see her through the walls, knock on her door. She only opens it to someone who can see her.","farmingTillieRabbitHintTrade":"Take a spare Carrot [[Carrot]] with you. She\'ll trade you a Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]] for it, so long as you mind your manners.","farmingTillieRabbitHintMoves":"She moves between her burrows, mind. If she\'s not where you found her last time, look through the others.","farmingRabbitKnockWelcome":"Oh! Peering through my walls, are you? Well, don\'t stand there letting the draught in. Come in, and quietly, please.","farmingRabbitKnockWelcomeBack":"Found me again, have you, dear? So much for my peace and quiet. Oh, come in. It\'s nice to see a familiar face.","farmingRabbitKnockPrompt":"Knock","farmingRabbitKnockNoAnswer":"Knock Knock - No answer...","farmingRabbitKnockEmpty":"Nobody\'s home. Look for Lady Proudfeet through the walls.","questFarmingGrandSweetName":"The Sweet Course","questFarmingGrandSweetDescription":"They\'re hungry again, and this time they want a proper feast. Sweets first: bring me 400 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]] from Stagstep Gardens.","questFarmingGrandSweetGoldWatermelonCollect":"Collect 4 Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]]","questFarmingGrandSweetGoldWatermelonDelivery":"Bring Clatter 4 Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]]","questFarmingGrandSweetGoldWatermelonGather":"Eat a Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]], then jump up to a Gold Watermelon Stag at Stagstep Gardens and feed it 4 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]] for each Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]], until you have 4. Then cut more Watermelon [[Watermelon]] to get back to 400 slices.","questFarmingGrandSweetGoldWatermelonDeliver":"Bring 4 Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingGrandSweetGoldWatermelonReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]]. Bring them to me at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingGrandSweetGoldWatermelonCompleted":"Golden slices for the top of the pudding. Lovely.","questFarmingGrandSweetWatermelonCollect":"Collect 400 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]]","questFarmingGrandSweetWatermelonDelivery":"Bring Clatter 400 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]]","questFarmingGrandSweetWatermelonGather":"Harvest ripe Watermelon [[Watermelon]] at Stagstep Gardens until you have 400 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]]. Each one gives 4 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]].","questFarmingGrandSweetWatermelonDeliver":"Bring 400 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingGrandSweetWatermelonReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]]. Bring them to me at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingGrandSweetWatermelonCompleted":"That\'s a lot of watermelon. Into the cold store it goes.","questFarmingGrandSweetGoldMelonCollect":"Collect 6 Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]]","questFarmingGrandSweetGoldMelonDelivery":"Bring Clatter 6 Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]]","questFarmingGrandSweetGoldMelonGather":"Eat a Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]] at Meloncloak Grove to turn invisible, then slip past the guards and pick up 6 Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]]. Each one is back 5 seconds after you take it. Cut another Melon [[Melon]] to replace the slice you ate and keep your 400 slices.","questFarmingGrandSweetGoldMelonDeliver":"Bring 6 Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingGrandSweetGoldMelonReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]]. Bring them to me at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingGrandSweetGoldMelonCompleted":"Six golden slices, and not a guard the wiser! That\'s the sweets done. They\'ll be licking their plates.","questFarmingGrandSweetMelonCollect":"Collect 400 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]]","questFarmingGrandSweetMelonDelivery":"Bring Clatter 400 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]]","questFarmingGrandSweetMelonGather":"Harvest ripe Melon [[Melon]] at Meloncloak Grove until you have 400 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]]. Each one gives 4 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]].","questFarmingGrandSweetMelonDeliver":"Bring 400 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingGrandSweetMelonReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]]. Bring them to me at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingGrandSweetMelonCompleted":"Four hundred melon slices! The cold store is filling up nicely.","questFarmingGrandFieldsName":"Bread and Chips","questFarmingGrandFieldsDescription":"Next, bread and chips. Tillie\'s fields in the hub grow the best Wheat [[Wheat]] and Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]]. Bring me 200 Wheat [[Wheat]] to start.","questFarmingGrandFieldsWheatCollect":"Collect 200 Wheat [[Wheat]]","questFarmingGrandFieldsWheatDelivery":"Bring Clatter 200 Wheat [[Wheat]]","questFarmingGrandFieldsWheatGather":"Go back to the hub and harvest 200 Wheat [[Wheat]] in Tillie\'s fields.","questFarmingGrandFieldsWheatDeliver":"Bring 200 Wheat [[Wheat]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingGrandFieldsWheatReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Wheat [[Wheat]]. Bring them to me at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingGrandFieldsWheatCompleted":"Good flour, that. The bread\'s in the oven.","questFarmingGrandFieldsPotatoCollect":"Collect 100 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]]","questFarmingGrandFieldsPotatoDelivery":"Bring Clatter 100 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]]","questFarmingGrandFieldsPotatoGather":"Go back to the hub and harvest 100 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]] in Tillie\'s fields.","questFarmingGrandFieldsPotatoDeliver":"Bring 100 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingGrandFieldsPotatoReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]]. Bring them to me at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingGrandFieldsPotatoCompleted":"Bread [[Bread]] rising, chips frying. That smell will keep them quiet for a minute.","questFarmingGrandRootsName":"Roots and Dairy","questFarmingGrandRootsDescription":"Now roots and dairy. First, 3 Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]] from Lady Proudfeet. Mind her door; she likes her peace.","questFarmingGrandRootsGoldCarrotCollect":"Collect 3 Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]]","questFarmingGrandRootsGoldCarrotDelivery":"Bring Clatter 3 Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]]","questFarmingGrandRootsGoldCarrotGather":"Eat a Carrot [[Carrot]] in Goldenroot Burrow to spot Lady Proudfeet through the burrow walls. Knock on her door, go in and trade her 1 Carrot [[Carrot]] for each Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]], until you have 3.","questFarmingGrandRootsGoldCarrotDeliver":"Bring 3 Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingGrandRootsGoldCarrotReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]]. Bring them to me at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingGrandRootsGoldCarrotCompleted":"Three golden carrots. Lady Proudfeet is too kind.","questFarmingGrandRootsCarrotCollect":"Collect 300 Carrot [[Carrot]]","questFarmingGrandRootsCarrotDelivery":"Bring Clatter 300 Carrot [[Carrot]]","questFarmingGrandRootsCarrotGather":"Harvest fully grown Carrot [[Carrot]] at Goldenroot Burrow until you have 300 Carrot [[Carrot]].","questFarmingGrandRootsCarrotDeliver":"Bring 300 Carrot [[Carrot]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingGrandRootsCarrotReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Carrot [[Carrot]]. Bring them to me at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingGrandRootsCarrotCompleted":"Carrot [[Carrot]] for the stew. Chop, chop!","questFarmingGrandRootsTruffleCollect":"Collect 3 Truffle [[Truffle]]","questFarmingGrandRootsTruffleDelivery":"Bring Clatter 3 Truffle [[Truffle]]","questFarmingGrandRootsTruffleGather":"Feed the Cows in Snoutmeadow for milk, then trade 4 Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]] with Truff for each Truffle [[Truffle]] until you have 3 Truffle [[Truffle]].","questFarmingGrandRootsTruffleDeliver":"Bring 3 Truffle [[Truffle]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingGrandRootsTruffleReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Truffle [[Truffle]]. Bring them to me at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingGrandRootsTruffleCompleted":"Truffle [[Truffle]]! Napoleon will be pleased. Probably.","questFarmingGrandRootsMilkCollect":"Collect 150 Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]]","questFarmingGrandRootsMilkDelivery":"Bring Clatter 150 Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]]","questFarmingGrandRootsMilkGather":"Feed the Cows in Snoutmeadow 1 Wheat [[Wheat]] and 1 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]] for each Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]] until you have 150. Keep it for me; trading with Truff would use it up. Wheat [[Wheat]] grows in the hub\'s fields.","questFarmingGrandRootsMilkDeliver":"Bring 150 Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingGrandRootsMilkReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]]. Bring them to me at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingGrandRootsMilkCompleted":"Everything\'s in! I\'ll start cooking. While it simmers, Napoleon and his guests at the banquet table will want things from you. Keep them sweet.","questFarmingFeastName":"The Gilded Feast","questFarmingFeastDescription":"The feast is nearly done! It needs a golden touch from every corner of the farm, and the Gravy Court is getting restless. Bring me 2 Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]], 2 Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]], 2 Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]] and 1 Truffle [[Truffle]].","questFarmingFeastGoldWatermelonCollect":"Collect 2 Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]]","questFarmingFeastGoldWatermelonDelivery":"Bring Clatter 2 Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]]","questFarmingFeastGoldWatermelonGather":"Eat a Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]], then jump up to a Gold Watermelon Stag at Stagstep Gardens and feed it 4 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]] for each Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]], until you have 2.","questFarmingFeastGoldWatermelonDeliver":"Bring 2 Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingFeastGoldWatermelonReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]]. Bring them to me at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingFeastGoldWatermelonCompleted":"Golden watermelon for the centrepiece. Beautiful.","questFarmingFeastGoldCarrotCollect":"Collect 2 Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]]","questFarmingFeastGoldCarrotDelivery":"Bring Clatter 2 Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]]","questFarmingFeastGoldCarrotGather":"Eat a Carrot [[Carrot]] in Goldenroot Burrow to spot Lady Proudfeet through the burrow walls. Knock on her door, go in and trade her 1 Carrot [[Carrot]] for each Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]], until you have 2.","questFarmingFeastGoldCarrotDeliver":"Bring 2 Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingFeastGoldCarrotReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]]. Bring them to me at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingFeastGoldCarrotCompleted":"Golden carrots, glazed and gleaming.","questFarmingFeastGoldMelonCollect":"Collect 2 Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]]","questFarmingFeastGoldMelonDelivery":"Bring Clatter 2 Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]]","questFarmingFeastGoldMelonGather":"Eat a Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]] at Meloncloak Grove to turn invisible, then slip past the guards and pick up 2 Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]]. Each one is back 5 seconds after you take it.","questFarmingFeastGoldMelonDeliver":"Bring 2 Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingFeastGoldMelonReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]]. Bring them to me at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingFeastGoldMelonCompleted":"Golden melon, sliced thin. Nearly there!","questFarmingFeastTruffleCollect":"Collect 1 Truffle [[Truffle]]","questFarmingFeastTruffleDelivery":"Bring Clatter 1 Truffle [[Truffle]]","questFarmingFeastTruffleGather":"Feed the Cows in Snoutmeadow for milk, then trade 4 Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]] with Truff for each Truffle [[Truffle]] until you have 1 Truffle [[Truffle]].","questFarmingFeastTruffleDeliver":"Bring 1 Truffle [[Truffle]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingFeastTruffleReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Truffle [[Truffle]]. Bring them to me at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingFeastTruffleCompleted":"That\'s everything. It\'s plated! Go and tell Napoleon his feast is served.","questFarmingFeastServe":"Tell Napoleon the feast is served","questFarmingFeastServeDescription":"Go to Napoleon at the head of the banquet table in Hog\'s Gut Inn and tell him his feast is served.","questFarmingFeastHint":"Still cooking! Napoleon and his guests at the banquet table have requests for you: {{remaining}} more to go.","questFarmingFeastNudge":"Clatter has the feast nearly ready. Go and see him in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingFillWatermelonOneName":"Fill Up My Pantry: Watermelon","questFarmingFillWatermelonOneDescription":"Napoleon loved the feast, and now the Court wants one every day. Fill my pantry with 2,500 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]] and there\'s a cleaver in it for you.","questFarmingFillWatermelonOneCollect":"Collect 2,500 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]]","questFarmingFillWatermelonOneDelivery":"Bring Clatter 2,500 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]]","questFarmingFillWatermelonOneGather":"Harvest ripe Watermelon [[Watermelon]] at Stagstep Gardens until you have 2,500 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]]. Each one gives 4 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]].","questFarmingFillWatermelonOneDeliver":"Bring 2,500 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingFillWatermelonOneReminder":"{{remaining}} more Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]] to go. Stagstep Gardens is waiting!","questFarmingFillWatermelonOneCompleted":"What a haul! Take this Pantry Cleaver. Every swing takes another ripe watermelon nearby. The Court is already asking what\'s next.","questFarmingFillWatermelonTwoName":"Fill Up My Pantry: More Watermelon","questFarmingFillWatermelonTwoDescription":"They ate the lot and now they\'re grumbling at the empty shelf. Double it: 5,000 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]], and there\'s a banquet-sized cleaver in it.","questFarmingFillWatermelonTwoCollect":"Collect 5,000 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]]","questFarmingFillWatermelonTwoDelivery":"Bring Clatter 5,000 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]]","questFarmingFillWatermelonTwoGather":"Harvest ripe Watermelon [[Watermelon]] at Stagstep Gardens until you have 5,000 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]]. Each one gives 4 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]].","questFarmingFillWatermelonTwoDeliver":"Bring 5,000 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingFillWatermelonTwoReminder":"{{remaining}} more Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]] to go. Stagstep Gardens is waiting!","questFarmingFillWatermelonTwoCompleted":"Five thousand! Here\'s the Banquet Cleaver. Every swing takes two more ripe watermelons nearby. The pantry\'s full, for about a minute.","questFarmingFillCarrotOneName":"Fill Up My Pantry: Carrots","questFarmingFillCarrotOneDescription":"The Court says carrots are beneath them, yet they ate three platefuls. Fill my pantry with 1,000 Carrot [[Carrot]] and there\'s a sharp new hoe in it for you.","questFarmingFillCarrotOneCollect":"Collect 1,000 Carrot [[Carrot]]","questFarmingFillCarrotOneDelivery":"Bring Clatter 1,000 Carrot [[Carrot]]","questFarmingFillCarrotOneGather":"Harvest fully grown Carrot [[Carrot]] at Goldenroot Burrow until you have 1,000 Carrot [[Carrot]].","questFarmingFillCarrotOneDeliver":"Bring 1,000 Carrot [[Carrot]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingFillCarrotOneReminder":"{{remaining}} more Carrot [[Carrot]] to go. Goldenroot Burrow is waiting!","questFarmingFillCarrotOneCompleted":"A mountain of carrots! Take this Pantry Cutter. It clears up to 5 more carrots around the one you pick.","questFarmingFillCarrotTwoName":"Fill Up My Pantry: More Carrots","questFarmingFillCarrotTwoDescription":"Gone already! 2,000 Carrot [[Carrot]] this time, and there\'s a golden hoe in it for you.","questFarmingFillCarrotTwoCollect":"Collect 2,000 Carrot [[Carrot]]","questFarmingFillCarrotTwoDelivery":"Bring Clatter 2,000 Carrot [[Carrot]]","questFarmingFillCarrotTwoGather":"Harvest fully grown Carrot [[Carrot]] at Goldenroot Burrow until you have 2,000 Carrot [[Carrot]].","questFarmingFillCarrotTwoDeliver":"Bring 2,000 Carrot [[Carrot]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingFillCarrotTwoReminder":"{{remaining}} more Carrot [[Carrot]] to go. Goldenroot Burrow is waiting!","questFarmingFillCarrotTwoCompleted":"Two thousand carrots! The Banquet Cutter is yours. It clears every carrot around the one you pick.","questFarmingFillMelonOneName":"Fill Up My Pantry: Melon","questFarmingFillMelonOneDescription":"The Court mutters that Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]] are too fiddly, then asks for more. Fill my pantry with 2,500 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]] and there\'s a fine new blade in it.","questFarmingFillMelonOneCollect":"Collect 2,500 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]]","questFarmingFillMelonOneDelivery":"Bring Clatter 2,500 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]]","questFarmingFillMelonOneGather":"Harvest ripe Melon [[Melon]] at Meloncloak Grove until you have 2,500 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]]. Each one gives 4 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]].","questFarmingFillMelonOneDeliver":"Bring 2,500 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingFillMelonOneReminder":"{{remaining}} more Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]] to go. Meloncloak Grove is waiting!","questFarmingFillMelonOneCompleted":"Lovely! Take this Pantry Carver. Every Melon [[Melon]] gives you 2 extra slices with it.","questFarmingFillMelonTwoName":"Fill Up My Pantry: More Melon","questFarmingFillMelonTwoDescription":"More melons! 5,000 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]] this time, and there\'s a banquet blade in it for you.","questFarmingFillMelonTwoCollect":"Collect 5,000 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]]","questFarmingFillMelonTwoDelivery":"Bring Clatter 5,000 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]]","questFarmingFillMelonTwoGather":"Harvest ripe Melon [[Melon]] at Meloncloak Grove until you have 5,000 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]]. Each one gives 4 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]].","questFarmingFillMelonTwoDeliver":"Bring 5,000 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]] to Clatter in the kitchen at Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingFillMelonTwoReminder":"{{remaining}} more Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]] to go. Meloncloak Grove is waiting!","questFarmingFillMelonTwoCompleted":"Five thousand slices! Here\'s the Banquet Carver: 4 extra slices from every Melon [[Melon]]. Napoleon told me, \'A full pantry is a quiet Court, cook.\' I mean to keep it that way.","farmingBaronQuestGreeting":"Ah. You have come about my dinner, I hope.","farmingBaronInventoryFull":"Your pockets are full. Empty them; I do not hand gifts into clutter.","farmingBaronIdleFed":"A splendid feast. For now, I am content.","farmingBaronServeFeast":"At last. The finest meal I have ever eaten. How pleasant it is when things do as they are told. There will be another course, naturally.","farmingGuest1QuestGreeting":"Ah, you. Have you brought my plate?","farmingGuest1InventoryFull":"Your pockets are stuffed! Make room first, would you?","farmingGuest1IdleFed":"Finally, a plate of proper size.","farmingGuest1Cheer":"Bravo! Now that is a feast!","farmingGuest2QuestGreeting":"Darling! Is that for me?","farmingGuest2InventoryFull":"Darling, your bags are bursting. Make some room.","farmingGuest2IdleFed":"Gold on everything. Perfect.","farmingGuest2Cheer":"Divine, darling! Simply divine!","farmingGuest3QuestGreeting":"You again. Is it the finest?","farmingGuest3InventoryFull":"Your inventory is full. Do tidy it first.","farmingGuest3IdleFed":"The finest. I shall order it twice more.","farmingGuest3Cheer":"Acceptable. Very acceptable indeed.","farmingGuest4QuestGreeting":"Is that for me? Napoleon can wait.","farmingGuest4InventoryFull":"Your bags are full. Make room, and be quick about it.","farmingGuest4IdleFed":"I had more than Napoleon. I counted.","farmingGuest4Cheer":"Hooray! I had the biggest helping!","farmingGuest5QuestGreeting":"Oink? Conspicuous Pig noses his empty plate.","farmingGuest5InventoryFull":"Conspicuous Pig snuffles at your bulging pockets. Make room for your reward.","farmingGuest5IdleFed":"Conspicuous Pig lets out a contented snuffle.","farmingGuest5Cheer":"Oink! Oink!","farmingGuest6QuestGreeting":"Food? Is that food?","farmingGuest6InventoryFull":"No room in your bags? Make some, then. Quickly!","farmingGuest6IdleFed":"Is there pudding? There must be pudding.","farmingGuest6Cheer":"More! More! Hooray!","questFarmingCourtCarrotsName":"A Bigger Plate of Carrots","questFarmingCourtCarrotsDescription":"These carrot portions are an insult. Sixty, if you please. Sixty!","questFarmingCourtCarrotsCollect":"Collect 60 Carrot [[Carrot]]","questFarmingCourtCarrotsDelivery":"Bring Lord Snufflesworth 60 Carrot [[Carrot]]","questFarmingCourtCarrotsGather":"Harvest fully grown Carrot [[Carrot]] at Goldenroot Burrow until you have 60 Carrot [[Carrot]].","questFarmingCourtCarrotsDeliver":"Bring 60 Carrot [[Carrot]] to Lord Snufflesworth at the banquet table in Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingCourtCarrotsReminder":"Only {{remaining}} more Carrot [[Carrot]]? My plate is still embarrassingly empty.","questFarmingCourtCarrotsCompleted":"Sixty carrots. Hmph. A respectable start.","questFarmingCourtWatermelonName":"The Finest Watermelon, Twice","questFarmingCourtWatermelonDescription":"I ordered the finest watermelon. Twice. Bring me 120 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]].","questFarmingCourtWatermelonCollect":"Collect 120 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]]","questFarmingCourtWatermelonDelivery":"Bring Count Crackling 120 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]]","questFarmingCourtWatermelonGather":"Harvest ripe Watermelon [[Watermelon]] at Stagstep Gardens until you have 120 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]]. Each one gives 4 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]].","questFarmingCourtWatermelonDeliver":"Bring 120 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]] to Count Crackling at the banquet table in Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingCourtWatermelonReminder":"{{remaining}} more Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]]. I did say twice.","questFarmingCourtWatermelonCompleted":"Adequate. I shall order it again.","questFarmingCourtGoldMelonName":"Golden Garnish","questFarmingCourtGoldMelonDescription":"My plate is dreadfully plain. Fetch me 2 Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]] for garnish, darling.","questFarmingCourtGoldMelonCollect":"Collect 2 Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]]","questFarmingCourtGoldMelonDelivery":"Bring Duchess Porcella 2 Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]]","questFarmingCourtGoldMelonGather":"Eat a Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]] at Meloncloak Grove to turn invisible, then slip past the guards and pick up 2 Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]]. Each one is back 5 seconds after you take it.","questFarmingCourtGoldMelonDeliver":"Bring 2 Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]] to Duchess Porcella at the banquet table in Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingCourtGoldMelonReminder":"{{remaining}} more Gold Melon Slice [[Gold Melon Slice]], darling. Gold goes with everything.","questFarmingCourtGoldMelonCompleted":"Gold! Now it looks like dinner.","questFarmingCourtGoldWatermelonName":"Napoleon\'s Golden Slices","questFarmingCourtGoldWatermelonDescription":"Two Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]], if you please. The stags keep them for me; they simply don\'t know it yet.","questFarmingCourtGoldWatermelonCollect":"Collect 2 Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]]","questFarmingCourtGoldWatermelonDelivery":"Bring Napoleon 2 Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]]","questFarmingCourtGoldWatermelonGather":"Eat a Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]], then jump up to a Gold Watermelon Stag at Stagstep Gardens and feed it 4 Watermelon Slice [[Watermelon Slice]] for each Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]], until you have 2.","questFarmingCourtGoldWatermelonDeliver":"Bring 2 Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]] to Napoleon at the head of the banquet table in Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingCourtGoldWatermelonReminder":"{{remaining}} more Gold Watermelon Slice [[Gold Watermelon Slice]]. I do not like waiting for what is already mine.","questFarmingCourtGoldWatermelonCompleted":"You are useful. I do remember useful.","questFarmingCourtTrufflesName":"More Truffles Than Napoleon","questFarmingCourtTrufflesDescription":"Napoleon had a Truffle [[Truffle]]. I want two. Truff in Snoutmeadow has them.","questFarmingCourtTrufflesCollect":"Collect 2 Truffle [[Truffle]]","questFarmingCourtTrufflesDelivery":"Bring Prince Porkington 2 Truffle [[Truffle]]","questFarmingCourtTrufflesGather":"Feed the Cows in Snoutmeadow for milk, then trade 4 Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]] with Truff for each Truffle [[Truffle]] until you have 2 Truffle [[Truffle]].","questFarmingCourtTrufflesDeliver":"Bring 2 Truffle [[Truffle]] to Prince Porkington at the banquet table in Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingCourtTrufflesReminder":"{{remaining}} more Truffle [[Truffle]]. Napoleon must not have more than me.","questFarmingCourtTrufflesCompleted":"Two truffles! Ha! Don\'t tell Napoleon.","questFarmingCourtMilkName":"Milk for Conspicuous Pig","questFarmingCourtMilkDescription":"Conspicuous Pig snuffles at his empty cup. Bring him 40 Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]].","questFarmingCourtMilkCollect":"Collect 40 Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]]","questFarmingCourtMilkDelivery":"Bring Conspicuous Pig 40 Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]]","questFarmingCourtMilkGather":"Feed the Cows in Snoutmeadow 1 Wheat [[Wheat]] and 1 Melon Slice [[Melon Slice]] for each Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]] until you have 40. Wheat [[Wheat]] grows in the hub\'s fields.","questFarmingCourtMilkDeliver":"Bring 40 Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]] to Conspicuous Pig at the banquet table in Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingCourtMilkReminder":"Conspicuous Pig noses his cup. He still wants {{remaining}} Cow\'s Milk [[Cow\'s Milk]].","questFarmingCourtMilkCompleted":"Conspicuous Pig drains his cup with a happy snuffle.","questFarmingCourtGoldCarrotsName":"Golden Carrots for the Duke","questFarmingCourtGoldCarrotsDescription":"More! Two Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]] from Lady Proudfeet, and quickly.","questFarmingCourtGoldCarrotsCollect":"Collect 2 Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]]","questFarmingCourtGoldCarrotsDelivery":"Bring Duke Swillbury 2 Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]]","questFarmingCourtGoldCarrotsGather":"Eat a Carrot [[Carrot]] in Goldenroot Burrow to spot Lady Proudfeet through the burrow walls. Knock on her door, go in and trade her 1 Carrot [[Carrot]] for each Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]], until you have 2.","questFarmingCourtGoldCarrotsDeliver":"Bring 2 Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]] to Duke Swillbury at the banquet table in Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingCourtGoldCarrotsReminder":"{{remaining}} more Gold Carrot [[Gold Carrot]]. A feast should never end.","questFarmingCourtGoldCarrotsCompleted":"Delicious. Now, what\'s next?","questFarmingCourtToothpicksName":"Toothpicks for His Lordship","questFarmingCourtToothpicksDescription":"A gentleman needs a toothpick after his carrots. Bring me 4 Stick [[Stick]].","questFarmingCourtToothpicksCollect":"Collect 4 Stick [[Stick]]","questFarmingCourtToothpicksDelivery":"Bring Lord Snufflesworth 4 Stick [[Stick]]","questFarmingCourtToothpicksGather":"Chop Maple Log [[Maple Log]] in the hub forest and craft 4 Stick [[Stick]] from planks, or bring 4 Stick [[Stick]] you already have.","questFarmingCourtToothpicksDeliver":"Bring 4 Stick [[Stick]] to Lord Snufflesworth at the banquet table in Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingCourtToothpicksReminder":"{{remaining}} more Stick [[Stick]], please. Something is stuck in my teeth.","questFarmingCourtToothpicksCompleted":"Splendid. I shall pick my teeth in style.","questFarmingCourtChairPlanksName":"A Chair Fit for a Count","questFarmingCourtChairPlanksDescription":"My chair wobbles. Bring me 8 Maple Wood Planks [[Maple Wood Planks]] to fix it.","questFarmingCourtChairPlanksCollect":"Collect 8 Maple Wood Planks [[Maple Wood Planks]]","questFarmingCourtChairPlanksDelivery":"Bring Count Crackling 8 Maple Wood Planks [[Maple Wood Planks]]","questFarmingCourtChairPlanksGather":"Chop Maple Log [[Maple Log]] in the hub forest and craft 8 Maple Wood Planks [[Maple Wood Planks]], or bring 8 planks you already have.","questFarmingCourtChairPlanksDeliver":"Bring 8 Maple Wood Planks [[Maple Wood Planks]] to Count Crackling at the banquet table in Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingCourtChairPlanksReminder":"{{remaining}} more Maple Wood Planks [[Maple Wood Planks]]. The wobbling continues.","questFarmingCourtChairPlanksCompleted":"Steady at last. One may now dine with dignity.","questFarmingCourtBowlsName":"Bigger Bowls","questFarmingCourtBowlsDescription":"These bowls are far too small. Bring me 4 Bowl [[Bowl]] so I can eat from four at once.","questFarmingCourtBowlsCollect":"Collect 4 Bowl [[Bowl]]","questFarmingCourtBowlsDelivery":"Bring Duke Swillbury 4 Bowl [[Bowl]]","questFarmingCourtBowlsGather":"Chop Maple Log [[Maple Log]] in the hub forest and craft 4 Bowl [[Bowl]] from planks, or bring 4 Bowl [[Bowl]] you already have.","questFarmingCourtBowlsDeliver":"Bring 4 Bowl [[Bowl]] to Duke Swillbury at the banquet table in Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingCourtBowlsReminder":"{{remaining}} more Bowl [[Bowl]]. One bowl is never enough.","questFarmingCourtBowlsCompleted":"Four bowls! Now we\'re feasting.","questFarmingCourtWheatName":"A Loaf Bigger Than Napoleon\'s","questFarmingCourtWheatDescription":"I want a loaf bigger than Napoleon\'s. Bring me 30 Wheat [[Wheat]] from Tillie\'s fields in the hub.","questFarmingCourtWheatCollect":"Collect 30 Wheat [[Wheat]]","questFarmingCourtWheatDelivery":"Bring Prince Porkington 30 Wheat [[Wheat]]","questFarmingCourtWheatGather":"Go back to the hub and harvest 30 Wheat [[Wheat]] in Tillie\'s fields.","questFarmingCourtWheatDeliver":"Bring 30 Wheat [[Wheat]] to Prince Porkington at the banquet table in Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingCourtWheatReminder":"{{remaining}} more Wheat [[Wheat]]. His loaf is still bigger.","questFarmingCourtWheatCompleted":"Now my loaf is the biggest. As it should be.","questFarmingCourtPotatoesName":"Potatoes for Conspicuous Pig","questFarmingCourtPotatoesDescription":"Conspicuous Pig snuffles at his empty plate. Bring him 20 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]] from Tillie\'s fields in the hub.","questFarmingCourtPotatoesCollect":"Collect 20 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]]","questFarmingCourtPotatoesDelivery":"Bring Conspicuous Pig 20 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]]","questFarmingCourtPotatoesGather":"Go back to the hub and harvest 20 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]] in Tillie\'s fields.","questFarmingCourtPotatoesDeliver":"Bring 20 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]] to Conspicuous Pig at the banquet table in Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingCourtPotatoesReminder":"Conspicuous Pig noses his plate. He still wants {{remaining}} Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]].","questFarmingCourtPotatoesCompleted":"Conspicuous Pig munches happily. Oink!","questFarmingCourtFishName":"A Fish for the Duchess","questFarmingCourtFishDescription":"I simply must have a fish, fresh from the water. Catch me one, darling.","questFarmingCourtFishCollect":"Collect 1 fish","questFarmingCourtFishDelivery":"Bring Duchess Porcella 1 fish","questFarmingCourtFishGather":"Catch any fish in the hub\'s water with your rod, or bring a fish you already have. Duchess Porcella takes your commonest fish first.","questFarmingCourtFishDeliver":"Bring 1 fish to Duchess Porcella at the banquet table in Hog\'s Gut Inn.","questFarmingCourtFishReminder":"I\'m still waiting for {{remaining}} fish, darling.","questFarmingCourtFishCompleted":"Fresh fish! I shall have it with gold on top.","doubleCatch":"Double catch!","fishBiteClick":"A fish is biting! Click to catch it!","fishBiteTap":"A fish is biting! Tap to catch it!","fishReelClick":"A fish is biting! Click repeatedly to reel it in!","fishReelTap":"A fish is biting! Tap repeatedly to reel it in!","compassUnvisitedZone":"Unvisited zone","lootCoins":"Coins","maverickInventoryFull":"Whoa, your pack\'s full! Make some room and come back for this.","timbertoothInventoryFull":"Pack\'s full. Clear a space, then I\'ll hand it over.","lorenzoInventoryFull":"A fine prize deserves room in your pack. Return when you\'ve made some.","rubyInventoryFull":"That pack\'s tighter than bedrock! Clear a slot and I\'ll hand this over.","tillieInventoryFull":"Your basket is full, dear. Make a little room and come back.","blubberbeardInventoryFull":"Your pack\'s full, matey. Clear a berth and come back.","watchDogInventoryFull":"Your pack is full. Clear space before I hand over the reward.","miniInventoryFull":"No room in that pack. Clear some, then try me again.","npcRewardPickedUp":"Received: ","currentBenefit":"Current benefit","foragingBenefit":"+{{bonus}}% wood breaking speed.","foragingBenefitChange":"{{before}}% \u2192 {{after}}% wood breaking speed.","combatBenefit":"+{{bonus}}% damage against mobs.","combatBenefitChange":"{{before}}% \u2192 {{after}}% damage against mobs.","miningBenefit":"+{{bonus}}% rock breaking speed.","miningBenefitChange":"{{before}}% \u2192 {{after}}% rock breaking speed.","farmingBenefit":"+{{bonus}}% extra crops.","farmingBenefitChange":"{{before}}% \u2192 {{after}}% extra crops.","fishingBenefit":"{{bonus}}% shorter bite wait.","fishingBenefitChange":"{{before}}% \u2192 {{after}}% shorter bite wait.","explorationBenefit":"+{{bonus}}% movement speed.","explorationBenefitChange":"{{before}}% \u2192 {{after}}% movement speed.","terrainFarmingSource":"Dirt [[Dirt]], Grass Block [[Grass Block]], Sand [[Sand]] and Gravel [[Gravel]]: {{xp}} XP per harvested block.","questCompletedTitle":"Quest complete","dailyRewardTitle":"Daily Reward","dailyRewardDay":"Day {{day}}","dailyRewardComeBack":"Come back tomorrow for","subquestCompletedTitle":"Step complete","questNextStepTitle":"Next step","questNextQuestTitle":"Next quest: {{quest}}","questExploreTitle":"What\'s next?","questExploreName":"Explore the world","questExploreDescription":"Talk to people you meet to discover new quests.","questCoinRewardSuffix":" (+{{amount}} [[Gold Coin]])","questCrossToHubPlanksDescription":"Gather logs, craft planks, bridge the gap and enter the Hub portal.","questCraftPlanksName":"Craft 12 Maple Wood Planks [[Maple Wood Planks]]","questCraftPlanksDescription":"Craft 12 Maple Wood Planks [[Maple Wood Planks]] from your 3 logs, at the Workbench [[Workbench]] or from your inventory.","questMeetMastersAlreadyDone":"Met them all already? Now that\'s an adventurer! Here\'s a little something for the trouble.","questGrowWheatSquareName":"Grow 9 Wheat [[Wheat]] in a 3 by 3 Square on Your Island","maverickQuestGreeting":"There you are, adventurer! Come and talk to me.","miniQuestGreeting":"You again. Come on, then. Let\'s talk.","watchDogHallOverview":"You\'re in the dungeon hall. Choose your boss at a dungeon\'s statue, clear its creatures, and defeat the boss. Stay alert\u2014we keep this danger from reaching the Hub.","watchDogQuestGreeting":"Resident. If you have business with me, step up and report.","questNightWatchPotatoesName":"Dig up 2 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]]","questNightWatchPotatoes":"Dig up 2 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]] at Tillie\'s Patch, the farm in the hub. Good eyes start with good food.","questFurRunHandInDescription":"Bring the 12 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]] to Watch Dog at the dungeon portal, and his spare fur is yours in trade.","questDungeonClearanceName":"Cleared for Duty","questDungeonClearanceDescription":"Halt, resident. These dungeons are no place for the untested, and nobody fights in them without my clearance.","questDungeonClearanceReportName":"Report to Watch Dog","questDungeonClearanceReport":"Report to me between the hall\'s first two boss statues.","questDungeonClearanceBriefing":"Each statue in this hall seals a dungeon, with a boss waiting at its heart. Skullforge\'s is the Forge Warden, a stone golem that would flatten a new recruit. Once you can hold your own against the Zombies in the Hub\'s Badlands, I\'ll clear you to face it.","questDungeonClearanceTrainName":"Train to Combat Level 3","questDungeonClearanceTrain":"Fight the Zombies in the Hub\'s Badlands until you can hold your own. Skullforge\'s statue opens to you once you can.","questDungeonClearanceBossName":"Defeat the Forge Warden in Skullforge","questDungeonClearanceBoss":"You\'re cleared. Use Skullforge\'s statue in the dungeon hall, fight through to its heart and bring down the Forge Warden.","questForagingFirstHandInDescription":"Bring the logs back to me in the Hub. I\'ll check the cuts.","questForagingFirstCollect":"Chop 10 Maple Log [[Maple Log]]","questForagingSecondHandInDescription":"Bring the 20 logs to me in the woods. The Wooden Mapletwin is ready for you.","questForagingSecondCollect":"Chop 20 more Maple Log [[Maple Log]]","questForagingDailyName":"Daily Chop","questForagingDailyErrand":"Everything I need today comes from the maples in my woods. Bring it to me when you\'re done.","questForagingDailyHandIn":"Bring today\'s wood back to me. I\'ll check the cuts.","questForagingDailyReminder":"Still {{remaining}} to go for today\'s work. Keep your cuts careful.","questForagingDailyCompleted":"Clean work, thank you. That\'s today\'s job sorted.","questForagingDailyDone":"That\'s today\'s work done. Come back tomorrow.","questForagingDailyLogs":"Back again? Good. I need 12 Maple Logs [[Maple Log]] for today\'s work. Careful cuts.","questForagingDailyLogsCollect":"Chop 12 Maple Logs [[Maple Log]]","questForagingDailyLogsDelivery":"Bring Timbertooth 12 Maple Logs [[Maple Log]]","questForagingDailyLogPile":"The woodpile\'s low today. Bring me 20 Maple Logs [[Maple Log]], if your arms are up to it.","questForagingDailyLogPileCollect":"Chop 20 Maple Logs [[Maple Log]]","questForagingDailyLogPileDelivery":"Bring Timbertooth 20 Maple Logs [[Maple Log]]","questForagingDailyPlanks":"I\'m mending the shed today. Bring me 32 Maple Wood Planks [[Maple Wood Planks]].","questForagingDailyPlanksCollect":"Make 32 Maple Wood Planks [[Maple Wood Planks]]","questForagingDailyPlanksDelivery":"Bring Timbertooth 32 Maple Wood Planks [[Maple Wood Planks]]","questAncientWoodlandHandInDescription":"Bring the ancient wood to me. Handle it with care.","questAncientWoodlandCollect":"Chop sparkling maples for 16 Ancient Maple Log [[Ancient Maple Log]]","questCombatFirstHandInDescription":"Return and present your spoils to me, duellist. Every hero deserves an audience!","questCombatFirstCollect":"Collect 4 Rotten Flesh [[Rotten Flesh]]","questCombatSecondHandInDescription":"Bring your trophies back to me, and claim the finer blade you\'ve earned!","questCombatSecondCollect":"Collect 8 more Rotten Flesh [[Rotten Flesh]]","questCombatDailyName":"Daily Hunt","questCombatDailyErrand":"Face the Zombies roaming the Badlands and bring me your spoils, duellist!","questCombatDailyHandIn":"Return and present today\'s spoils to me, duellist!","questCombatDailyReminder":"Today\'s hunt needs {{remaining}} more. Chin up, duellist!","questCombatDailyCompleted":"Splendid work, duellist! Here\'s your purse for today\'s hunt.","questCombatDailyDone":"Today\'s hunt is done, brave duellist! Return tomorrow for another.","questCombatDailyHunt":"A new day, a new hunt! Bring me 6 Rotten Flesh [[Rotten Flesh]] from the Badlands Zombies.","questCombatDailyHuntCollect":"Collect 6 Rotten Flesh [[Rotten Flesh]]","questCombatDailyHuntDelivery":"Bring Lorenzo 6 Rotten Flesh [[Rotten Flesh]]","questCombatDailyGrandHunt":"A grand hunt today, duellist! Bring me 10 Rotten Flesh [[Rotten Flesh]] from the Badlands Zombies.","questCombatDailyGrandHuntCollect":"Collect 10 Rotten Flesh [[Rotten Flesh]]","questCombatDailyGrandHuntDelivery":"Bring Lorenzo 10 Rotten Flesh [[Rotten Flesh]]","questCombatDoubleStrikeCompleted":"Bravo! Thank you for thinning their ranks. Take my Duelling Sword. Land ten good strikes, then the next hits twice as hard!","lorenzoDoubleStrikeReady":"Double strike ready!","lorenzoSwordDoubleStrike":"Double strike!","questMiningFirstHandInDescription":"Haul that Coal [[Coal]] back to me, friend. Let\'s see what the rock gave up!","questMiningFirstCollect":"Mine 10 Coal [[Coal]]","questMiningSecondHandInDescription":"Bring the whole haul back to me, and that better pickaxe is yours!","questMiningSecondCollect":"Mine 20 more Coal [[Coal]]","questMiningDailyName":"Daily Haul","questMiningDailyErrand":"Mine it here in Ruby\'s Rockpile and haul it back to me, friend!","questMiningDailyHandIn":"Haul today\'s ore back to me, friend!","questMiningDailyReminder":"Another {{remaining}} and today\'s haul is done, friend. Don\'t let the rocks win!","questMiningDailyCompleted":"Lovely haul, thank you! Here\'s your share for today.","questMiningDailyDone":"That\'s today\'s haul in, friend! The rocks will keep till tomorrow.","questMiningDailyCoal":"Morning, friend! The forge is hungry. Bring me 10 Coal [[Coal]].","questMiningDailyCoalCollect":"Mine 10 Coal [[Coal]]","questMiningDailyCoalDelivery":"Bring Ruby 10 Coal [[Coal]]","questMiningDailyIron":"I\'ve a hankering for iron today. Bring me 4 Raw Iron [[Raw Iron]] from the Iron Ore [[Iron Ore]] here, friend!","questMiningDailyIronCollect":"Mine 4 Raw Iron [[Raw Iron]] from Iron Ore [[Iron Ore]]","questMiningDailyIronDelivery":"Bring Ruby 4 Raw Iron [[Raw Iron]]","questMiningDailyOre":"Bring me 8 Coal [[Coal]] or Raw Iron [[Raw Iron]] today, friend. Any mix you like!","questMiningDailyOreCollect":"Mine 8 Coal [[Coal]] or Raw Iron [[Raw Iron]]","questMiningDailyOreDelivery":"Bring Ruby 8 Coal [[Coal]] or Raw Iron [[Raw Iron]]","questCompressionCompressedName":"Squeezing Rocks","questCompressionCompressedDescription":"I\'ve a daft idea: squash stone until it squeaks. Bring me 1 Compressed Messy Stone [[Compressed Messy Stone]] and we\'ll see if it works.","questCompressionCompressedGatherName":"Collect 9 Messy Stone [[Messy Stone]]","questCompressionCompressedGather":"Mine Stone [[Stone]] at Ruby\'s Rockpile until you have 9 Messy Stone [[Messy Stone]].","questCompressionCompressedCraftName":"Craft 1 Compressed Messy Stone [[Compressed Messy Stone]]","questCompressionCompressedCraft":"Squash 9 Messy Stone [[Messy Stone]] into 1 Compressed Messy Stone [[Compressed Messy Stone]]. You can do it right from your inventory!","questCompressionCompressedDeliver":"Bring your Compressed Messy Stone [[Compressed Messy Stone]] to Ruby at Ruby\'s Rockpile.","questCompressionCompressedReminder":"{{remaining}} Compressed Messy Stone [[Compressed Messy Stone]] and we\'re away. The rock is losing, friend!","questCompressionCompressedDelivery":"Bring Ruby 1 Compressed Messy Stone [[Compressed Messy Stone]]","questCompressionCompressedCompleted":"Ha, heavier than it looks! It works, friend. Take these Iron Bar [[Iron Bar]], and don\'t go far. I reckon it\'ll squash even smaller.","questCompressionExtraName":"Double The Squeeze","questCompressionExtraDescription":"That squashing worked a treat! Let\'s squeeze harder: bring me 1 Extra Compressed Messy Stone [[Extra Compressed Messy Stone]].","questCompressionExtraGatherName":"Collect 81 Messy Stone [[Messy Stone]]","questCompressionExtraGather":"Mine Stone [[Stone]] at Ruby\'s Rockpile until you have 81 Messy Stone [[Messy Stone]]. Squashed stone counts too, so squash as you go!","questCompressionExtraCraftName":"Craft 1 Extra Compressed Messy Stone [[Extra Compressed Messy Stone]]","questCompressionExtraCraft":"Squash 9 Messy Stone [[Messy Stone]] into each Compressed Messy Stone [[Compressed Messy Stone]], then squash 9 of those into 1 Extra Compressed Messy Stone [[Extra Compressed Messy Stone]]. You can do it right from your inventory!","questCompressionExtraDeliver":"Bring your Extra Compressed Messy Stone [[Extra Compressed Messy Stone]] to Ruby at Ruby\'s Rockpile.","questCompressionExtraReminder":"Still {{remaining}} Extra Compressed Messy Stone [[Extra Compressed Messy Stone]] to go. Stubborn rock? Be more stubborn!","questCompressionExtraDelivery":"Bring Ruby 1 Extra Compressed Messy Stone [[Extra Compressed Messy Stone]]","questCompressionExtraCompleted":"Grand! That\'s a whole heap of stone in one little block. Have these Iron Bar [[Iron Bar]]. Don\'t wander off, mind. I\'ve something shiny in mind for the next squeeze.","questCompressionSuperName":"Compression Obsession","questCompressionSuperDescription":"Let\'s squeeze harder still. Bring me 1 Super Compressed Messy Stone [[Super Compressed Messy Stone]]. That\'s 729 Messy Stone [[Messy Stone]] squashed small, a proper dig this time, but there\'s a special pickaxe in it for you. Show that rock who\'s stubborn!","questCompressionSuperGatherName":"Collect 729 Messy Stone [[Messy Stone]]","questCompressionSuperGather":"Mine Stone [[Stone]] at Ruby\'s Rockpile until you have 729 Messy Stone [[Messy Stone]]. Squashed stone counts too, so squash as you go!","questCompressionSuperCraftName":"Craft 1 Super Compressed Messy Stone [[Super Compressed Messy Stone]]","questCompressionSuperCraft":"Squash 9 Extra Compressed Messy Stone [[Extra Compressed Messy Stone]] into 1 Super Compressed Messy Stone [[Super Compressed Messy Stone]].","questCompressionSuperDeliver":"Bring your Super Compressed Messy Stone [[Super Compressed Messy Stone]] to Ruby at Ruby\'s Rockpile.","questCompressionSuperReminder":"Still {{remaining}} Super Compressed Messy Stone [[Super Compressed Messy Stone]] short. The stone isn\'t going anywhere.","questCompressionSuperDelivery":"Bring Ruby 1 Super Compressed Messy Stone [[Super Compressed Messy Stone]]","questCompressionSuperCompleted":"Would you look at that! Thanks, friend. Take this Fool\'s Gold Pickaxe: the gold\'s fake, but it smashes stone quick, and now and then an ore coughs up a bonus. Squeeze harder next time and I\'ve a pickaxe that chases whole veins.","questCompressionHyperName":"Under Pressure","questCompressionHyperDescription":"Now we\'re getting serious. Bring me 1 Hyper Compressed Messy Stone [[Hyper Compressed Messy Stone]]. That\'s a mountain of stone, so keep that Fool\'s Gold Pickaxe swinging!","questCompressionHyperGatherName":"Collect 6,561 Messy Stone [[Messy Stone]]","questCompressionHyperGather":"Mine Stone [[Stone]] at Ruby\'s Rockpile until you have 6,561 Messy Stone [[Messy Stone]]. Squashed stone counts too, so squash as you go!","questCompressionHyperCraftName":"Craft 1 Hyper Compressed Messy Stone [[Hyper Compressed Messy Stone]]","questCompressionHyperCraft":"Squash 9 Super Compressed Messy Stone [[Super Compressed Messy Stone]] into 1 Hyper Compressed Messy Stone [[Hyper Compressed Messy Stone]].","questCompressionHyperDeliver":"Bring your Hyper Compressed Messy Stone [[Hyper Compressed Messy Stone]] to Ruby at Ruby\'s Rockpile.","questCompressionHyperReminder":"{{remaining}} Hyper Compressed Messy Stone [[Hyper Compressed Messy Stone]] still to bring me. Keep at it, friend. That rock is starting to sweat!","questCompressionHyperDelivery":"Bring Ruby 1 Hyper Compressed Messy Stone [[Hyper Compressed Messy Stone]]","questCompressionHyperCompleted":"Ha! Heavy as a hill and twice as stubborn, and you beat it anyway. Take this Vein Chaser Pickaxe, friend. Break one stone here in the hub and the stone touching it comes tumbling out too, and so do matching ores!","questCompressionUltraName":"Ultra Crush","questCompressionUltraDescription":"You\'ve got arms like a dwarf now! Bring me 1 Ultra Compressed Messy Stone [[Ultra Compressed Messy Stone]]. It\'s a huge pile of stone, so let that Vein Chaser Pickaxe tear through it. I know you can do it.","questCompressionUltraGatherName":"Collect 59,049 Messy Stone [[Messy Stone]]","questCompressionUltraGather":"Mine Stone [[Stone]] at Ruby\'s Rockpile until you have 59,049 Messy Stone [[Messy Stone]]. Squashed stone counts too, so squash as you go!","questCompressionUltraCraftName":"Craft 1 Ultra Compressed Messy Stone [[Ultra Compressed Messy Stone]]","questCompressionUltraCraft":"Squash 9 Hyper Compressed Messy Stone [[Hyper Compressed Messy Stone]] into 1 Ultra Compressed Messy Stone [[Ultra Compressed Messy Stone]].","questCompressionUltraDeliver":"Bring your Ultra Compressed Messy Stone [[Ultra Compressed Messy Stone]] to Ruby at Ruby\'s Rockpile.","questCompressionUltraReminder":"Still {{remaining}} Ultra Compressed Messy Stone [[Ultra Compressed Messy Stone]] to bring me. Carry it carefully, friend. It\'s heavier than a hill!","questCompressionUltraDelivery":"Bring Ruby 1 Ultra Compressed Messy Stone [[Ultra Compressed Messy Stone]]","questCompressionUltraCompleted":"Well, I never! I\'ve mined for years and never held one of these. Take this Compactor Pickaxe, friend. Stone [[Stone]] you dig here in the hub comes out already squashed, and now and then twice over!","questCompressionMegaName":"Mega Squash","questCompressionMegaDescription":"Right, the big one: 1 Mega Compressed Messy Stone [[Mega Compressed Messy Stone]]. Only the most stubborn miner could make it. Lucky for me, that\'s you! Keep that Compactor Pickaxe swinging.","questCompressionMegaGatherName":"Collect 531,441 Messy Stone [[Messy Stone]]","questCompressionMegaGather":"Mine Stone [[Stone]] at Ruby\'s Rockpile until you have 531,441 Messy Stone [[Messy Stone]]. Squashed stone counts too, so squash as you go!","questCompressionMegaCraftName":"Craft 1 Mega Compressed Messy Stone [[Mega Compressed Messy Stone]]","questCompressionMegaCraft":"Squash 9 Ultra Compressed Messy Stone [[Ultra Compressed Messy Stone]] into 1 Mega Compressed Messy Stone [[Mega Compressed Messy Stone]].","questCompressionMegaDeliver":"Bring your Mega Compressed Messy Stone [[Mega Compressed Messy Stone]] to Ruby at Ruby\'s Rockpile.","questCompressionMegaReminder":"{{remaining}} Mega Compressed Messy Stone [[Mega Compressed Messy Stone]] and you\'ve done it. Don\'t let the rock win now!","questCompressionMegaDelivery":"Bring Ruby 1 Mega Compressed Messy Stone [[Mega Compressed Messy Stone]]","questCompressionMegaCompleted":"You did it! I\'ve never held stone squashed this tight, and you made it. Stubborn rock? You were more stubborn! You\'ve earned my own prized pickaxe, friend. It breaks whole chunks of stone and ore at once, and some of that stone comes out squashed. Look after it for me!","questFarmingFirstHandInDescription":"Bring the Wheat [[Wheat]] back to me when you\'re ready, dear. There\'s no rush.","questFarmingFirstCollect":"Harvest 12 Wheat [[Wheat]]","questFarmingSecondHandInDescription":"Bring the Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]] to me, dear. Your field hoe is waiting.","questFarmingSecondCollect":"Harvest 24 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]]","questFarmingDailyName":"Daily Harvest","questFarmingDailyErrand":"Harvest them in my patch here in the hub, then bring them to me when you\'re ready, dear.","questFarmingDailyHandIn":"Bring today\'s harvest to me when you\'re ready, dear.","questFarmingDailyReminder":"Just {{remaining}} more for today\'s harvest, dear. There\'s no hurry.","questFarmingDailyCompleted":"Thank you, dear. A lovely harvest. Here\'s a little something for your help.","questFarmingDailyDone":"That\'s today\'s harvest in, dear. Come and see me again tomorrow.","questFarmingDailyWheat":"Good to see you, dear. Could you bring me 16 Wheat [[Wheat]] today?","questFarmingDailyWheatCollect":"Harvest 16 Wheat [[Wheat]]","questFarmingDailyWheatDelivery":"Bring Tillie 16 Wheat [[Wheat]]","questFarmingDailyPotatoes":"I\'m making a stew today, dear. Could you bring me 12 Raw Potatoes [[Raw Potato]]?","questFarmingDailyPotatoesCollect":"Harvest 12 Raw Potatoes [[Raw Potato]]","questFarmingDailyPotatoesDelivery":"Bring Tillie 12 Raw Potatoes [[Raw Potato]]","questFarmingDailyCrops":"Bring me 16 Wheat [[Wheat]] or Raw Potatoes [[Raw Potato]] today, dear. A mix is fine.","questFarmingDailyCropsCollect":"Harvest 16 Wheat [[Wheat]] or Raw Potatoes [[Raw Potato]]","questFarmingDailyCropsDelivery":"Bring Tillie 16 Wheat [[Wheat]] or Raw Potatoes [[Raw Potato]]","questGroundworkName":"Groundwork","questGroundworkDescription":"I\'d like to mend the edges of my patch, dear. Take this Stone Spade [[Stone Spade]] and gather 10 Grass Block [[Grass Block]] from the ground around my crops.","questGroundworkGrassCollect":"Gather 10 Grass Block [[Grass Block]]","questGroundworkGrassDescription":"Dig up 10 Grass Block [[Grass Block]] around Tillie\'s Patch here in the hub, dear. The bare soil they leave will grow back into grass in a few moments.","questGroundworkGrassDelivery":"Bring Tillie 10 Grass Block [[Grass Block]]","questGroundworkGrassHandIn":"Bring your 10 Grass Block [[Grass Block]] back to me at Tillie\'s Patch, dear.","questGroundworkGrassReminder":"Just {{remaining}} more Grass Block [[Grass Block]] from around my patch, dear.","questGroundworkGrassTurnIn":"Those will make a lovely green edge. Now gather 20 Dirt [[Dirt]] from the bare ground beside me, dear, so I can fill the low spots.","questGroundworkDirtCollect":"Gather 20 Dirt [[Dirt]]","questGroundworkDirtDescription":"Dig up 20 Dirt [[Dirt]] from the bare ground beside me at Tillie\'s Patch in the hub. Leave the rough ground to settle, dear; fresh Dirt [[Dirt]] will return in a few moments.","questGroundworkDirtDelivery":"Bring Tillie 20 Dirt [[Dirt]]","questGroundworkDirtHandIn":"Bring your 20 Dirt [[Dirt]] back to me at Tillie\'s Patch, dear.","questGroundworkDirtReminder":"I still need {{remaining}} more Dirt [[Dirt]] from the bare ground beside me, dear.","questGroundworkCompleted":"Thank you, dear. That will give my patch a little room to grow. Keep the spade for your own garden.","questFlashFreezePotatoes":"Dig up 12 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]]","questFlashFreezePotatoesDescription":"Dig up 12 Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]] in my patch, dear, and take them to Watch Dog at the dungeon portal. He\'ll trade his spare Fur [[Fur]] for them.","questFlashFreezePotatoesReminder":"Just {{remaining}} more Raw Potato [[Raw Potato]], dear, then take them to Watch Dog.","questFlashFreezeFurHandInDescription":"Bring the Fur [[Fur]] back to me, dear, and I\'ll start stitching. If you lose it, come and see me; Watch Dog left me a little spare.","questFlashFreezeIronCollect":"Smelt 3 Iron Bar [[Iron Bar]]","questFlashFreezeIronHandInDescription":"Bring me the Iron Bar [[Iron Bar]], dear, and I\'ll finish your chestplate.","questFlashFreezeWearCoat":"Put the Worn Fur Chestplate on first, dear. Frosty Wheat [[Wheat]] only counts while you wear it.","questFishingFirstHandInDescription":"Bring your catch back to me, matey.","questFishingFirstCollect":"Catch 4 fish","questFishingSecondHandInDescription":"Bring your catch to me, matey, and the sturdier rod is yours.","questFishingSecondCollect":"Catch 8 more fish","questFishingDailyName":"Daily Catch","questFishingDailyErrand":"Cast into the water by my shack, then bring the catch back to me.","questFishingDailyHandIn":"Bring today\'s catch back to me, matey.","questFishingDailyReminder":"Just {{remaining}} more for today\'s catch, matey.","questFishingDailyCompleted":"That\'s a fine catch, matey. Here\'s a little something for your trouble.","questFishingDailyDone":"That\'s today\'s catch landed, matey. The fish\'ll be biting again tomorrow.","questFishingDailyAny":"Back for more, matey? Bring me 4 fish today. Any kind will do.","questFishingDailyAnyCollect":"Catch 4 fish","questFishingDailyAnyDelivery":"Bring Blubberbeard 4 fish","questFishingDailyWheatfish":"I\'ve a craving for Wheatfish [[Wheatfish]] today, matey. Catch me one?","questFishingDailyWheatfishCollect":"Catch a Wheatfish [[Wheatfish]]","questFishingDailyWheatfishDelivery":"Bring Blubberbeard a Wheatfish [[Wheatfish]]","questFishingDailyDarter":"Today I\'m after a Darter [[Darter]], matey. Quick little thing. Catch me one?","questFishingDailyDarterCollect":"Catch a Darter [[Darter]]","questFishingDailyDarterDelivery":"Bring Blubberbeard a Darter [[Darter]]","questFishingDailySunsetMinnow":"I fancy a Sunset Minnow [[Sunset Minnow]] for supper. Catch me one, matey?","questFishingDailySunsetMinnowCollect":"Catch a Sunset Minnow [[Sunset Minnow]]","questFishingDailySunsetMinnowDelivery":"Bring Blubberbeard a Sunset Minnow [[Sunset Minnow]]","questFishingDailyNoWheatfish":"Bring me 3 fish today, matey. Anything but Wheatfish [[Wheatfish]]. I\'ve had my fill of those.","questFishingDailyNoWheatfishCollect":"Catch 3 fish other than Wheatfish [[Wheatfish]]","questFishingDailyNoWheatfishDelivery":"Bring Blubberbeard 3 fish other than Wheatfish [[Wheatfish]]","questFishingDailyNoDarter":"Bring me 3 fish today, matey. No Darters [[Darter]], mind. Too bony by half.","questFishingDailyNoDarterCollect":"Catch 3 fish other than Darters [[Darter]]","questFishingDailyNoDarterDelivery":"Bring Blubberbeard 3 fish other than Darters [[Darter]]","questFirstKnotName":"The First Knot","questFirstKnotDescription":"Every angler learns their first fish by heart. Catch a Wheatfish [[Wheatfish]], a Sunset Minnow [[Sunset Minnow]], a Red Strongfish [[Red Strongfish]] and a Boomerang Fish [[Boomerang Fish]] in any water here in the hub, matey.","questKnotHandIn":"Thank you, matey! Straight into my bucket.","questFirstKnotWheatfishDescription":"Catch or bring a Wheatfish [[Wheatfish]]. The commonest bite in these waters, and the first worth knowing.","questFirstKnotSunsetMinnowDescription":"Catch or bring a Sunset Minnow [[Sunset Minnow]]. Small and quick, and coloured like the evening sky.","questFirstKnotRedStrongfishDescription":"Catch or bring a Red Strongfish [[Red Strongfish]]. It pulls hard, so hold your line firm.","questFirstKnotBoomerangFishDescription":"Catch or bring a Boomerang Fish [[Boomerang Fish]]. Odd-shaped thing, and the shyest of these four, so keep casting, matey.","questFirstKnotReportDescription":"Got all four? Come back and see old Blubberbeard.","questFirstKnotCompleted":"All four fish, and your first knot tied. Thank you, matey. Take this Knotted Rod. Now and then it brings up two fish at once.","questFirstKnotWheatfish":"Catch or bring a Wheatfish [[Wheatfish]]","questFirstKnotSunsetMinnow":"Catch or bring a Sunset Minnow [[Sunset Minnow]]","questFirstKnotRedStrongfish":"Catch or bring a Red Strongfish [[Red Strongfish]]","questFirstKnotBoomerangFish":"Catch or bring a Boomerang Fish [[Boomerang Fish]]","questKnotReport":"Report back to Blubberbeard","questBowlineName":"The Bowline","questBowlineDescription":"You have the feel of the line now, matey. Next: a Darter [[Darter]], a Root Flounder [[Root Flounder]], a Greenfin Loach [[Greenfin Loach]], a Green Strongfish [[Green Strongfish]] and a shy Seahorse [[Seahorse]]. Cast in any water here in the hub.","questBowlineDarterDescription":"Catch or bring a Darter [[Darter]]. Quick as an arrow, but it bites often.","questBowlineRootFlounderDescription":"Catch or bring a Root Flounder [[Root Flounder]]. Flat as a plank and brown as an old root.","questBowlineGreenfinLoachDescription":"Catch or bring a Greenfin Loach [[Greenfin Loach]]. Slippery, so reel it in quickly.","questBowlineGreenStrongfishDescription":"Catch or bring a Green Strongfish [[Green Strongfish]]. Cousin to the Red, and it puts up a real fight.","questBowlineSeahorseDescription":"Catch or bring a Seahorse [[Seahorse]]. The shyest bite yet, so be patient, matey.","questBowlineReportDescription":"Got all five? Come back and see old Blubberbeard.","questBowlineCompleted":"Five more fish, and a fine Bowline tied. Thank you, matey. Take this Bowline Rod. Fish bite on it sooner, and it brings up two at once more often.","questBowlineDarter":"Catch or bring a Darter [[Darter]]","questBowlineRootFlounder":"Catch or bring a Root Flounder [[Root Flounder]]","questBowlineGreenfinLoach":"Catch or bring a Greenfin Loach [[Greenfin Loach]]","questBowlineGreenStrongfish":"Catch or bring a Green Strongfish [[Green Strongfish]]","questBowlineSeahorse":"Catch or bring a Seahorse [[Seahorse]]","questAnchorBendName":"The Anchor Bend","questAnchorBendDescription":"Now for some stronger fish, matey, and shyer ones too, so settle in for a longer wait: a Spined Stickleback [[Spined Stickleback]], a Moon Strongfish [[Moon Strongfish]], a Boulder Bass [[Boulder Bass]] and a Grass Snapper [[Grass Snapper]]. Cast in any water here in the hub.","questAnchorBendSpinedSticklebackDescription":"Catch or bring a Spined Stickleback [[Spined Stickleback]]. Prickly little thing, so hold on tight.","questAnchorBendMoonStrongfishDescription":"Catch or bring a Moon Strongfish [[Moon Strongfish]]. Pale as the moon, and strong as its cousins.","questAnchorBendBoulderBassDescription":"Catch or bring a Boulder Bass [[Boulder Bass]]. Heavy as a rock, so pull with all you have.","questAnchorBendGrassSnapperDescription":"Catch or bring a Grass Snapper [[Grass Snapper]]. It snaps quickly, so be ready.","questAnchorBendReportDescription":"Got all four? Come back and see old Blubberbeard.","questAnchorBendCompleted":"Four strong fish, and the Anchor Bend tied. Thank you, matey. Take this Anchor Rod. Fish bite on it a touch sooner, and rare fish bite on it far more often.","questAnchorBendSpinedStickleback":"Catch or bring a Spined Stickleback [[Spined Stickleback]]","questAnchorBendMoonStrongfish":"Catch or bring a Moon Strongfish [[Moon Strongfish]]","questAnchorBendBoulderBass":"Catch or bring a Boulder Bass [[Boulder Bass]]","questAnchorBendGrassSnapper":"Catch or bring a Grass Snapper [[Grass Snapper]]","questFishermansKnotName":"The Fisherman\'s Knot","questFishermansKnotDescription":"In all my years I\'ve seen a Crystalized Wheatfish [[Crystalized Wheatfish]] and a Moonstone Pupfish [[Moonstone Pupfish]] only a handful of times. Catch me one of each, matey.","questFishermansKnotCrystalizedWheatfishDescription":"Catch or bring a Crystalized Wheatfish [[Crystalized Wheatfish]]. It can slip off the hook, so hold on tight.","questFishermansKnotMoonstonePupfishDescription":"Catch or bring a Moonstone Pupfish [[Moonstone Pupfish]], the rarest fish in these waters. Be quick when it bites.","questFishermansKnotReportDescription":"Got them both? Come back and see old Blubberbeard.","questFishermansKnotCompleted":"Both of them! Few anglers ever see those, matey. Thank you. Take this Fisherman\'s Rod. Fish bite on it quicker than on any rod I\'ve given you, one catch in four brings up a second fish, and rare fish bite on it just as often as on your Anchor Rod.","questFishermansKnotCrystalizedWheatfish":"Catch or bring a Crystalized Wheatfish [[Crystalized Wheatfish]]","questFishermansKnotMoonstonePupfish":"Catch or bring a Moonstone Pupfish [[Moonstone Pupfish]]","woodyQuestGreeting":"You\'re back. Come and talk when you\'re ready.","catnissQuestGreeting":"Ah, my favourite challenger returns! Come, let us talk.","digoryQuestGreeting":"There you are, friend! Come and have a word.","gillQuestGreeting":"Hello again, dear. Come and have a chat when you\'re ready.","blubberbeardQuestGreeting":"Ahoy, matey! Come and have a word with old Blubberbeard.","mobStalker":"Stalker","mobCrone":"Crone","dungeonSkullforgeName":"Skullforge","dungeonWildwoodGroveName":"Wildwood Grove","dungeonOpenChest":" to open loot chest","dungeonUpgradeHealthRegen":"Regen","dungeonUpgradeInstantHealth":"HP","dungeonUpgradeDamage":"Damage","dungeonUpgradeLifesteal":"Lifesteal","dungeonUpgradeDamageReduction":"Resistance","dungeonUpgradeThorns":"Thorns","dungeonUpgradeSpeed":"Speed","dungeonUpgradeJumpBoost":"Jump","dungeonUpgradeDoubleJump":"Air jump","dungeonRunFindBoss":"Find the Boss","dungeonRunFindBossDescription":"Somewhere deep in {{dungeon}} ({{difficulty}}), a boss waits. Clear each room to open the way onwards until you find it.","dungeonRunClearNextRoom":"Clear the Next Room","dungeonRunClearRoomDescription":"Defeat every monster here to open the door onwards.","dungeonRunRoomCleared":"Room {{room}} Cleared \u2013 {{time}}","dungeonRunRoomClearedDescription":"The door opened at {{time}} on the run clock.","dungeonRunReachBoss":"Go Through the Open Door","dungeonRunReachBossDescription":"The way ahead is open. Step through to face whatever waits beyond.","dungeonRunDefeatBossQuest":"Defeat the Boss","dungeonRunDefeatBossQuestDescription":"The door has sealed behind you. Defeat the {{boss}} to conquer {{dungeon}}.","dungeonRunDefeatBoss":"Slay the {{boss}}","dungeonRunDefeatBossDescription":"The door stays shut until the {{boss}} falls.","bossForgeWarden":"Forge Warden","bossIronForgeWarden":"Iron Forge Warden","bossCorruptedForgeWarden":"Corrupted Forge Warden","bossMoltenForgeWarden":"Molten Forge Warden","bossFrostWraith":"Frost Wraith","bossTatteredWraith":"Tattered Wraith","bossFrostKing":"Frost King","bossAccursedWraith":"Accursed Wraith","bossTikiTerror":"Tiki Terror","bossTikiTormentor":"Tiki Tormentor","bossTikiTitan":"Tiki Titan","bossTikiTyrant":"Tiki Tyrant","dungeonStatuePrompt":"Choose a boss","dungeonFight":"Fight","dungeonBossLocked":"Beat this dungeon\'s {{difficulty}} boss ({{boss}}) to unlock this boss","dungeonBossLockedUnseen":"Beat this dungeon\'s {{difficulty}} boss to unlock this boss","dungeonBossLockedUnseenElsewhere":"Beat {{dungeon}}\'s {{difficulty}} boss to unlock this boss","dungeonBossLockedElsewhere":"Beat {{boss}} in {{dungeon}} to unlock this boss","dungeonBossLockedCombat":"Reach {{skill}} to unlock this boss","dungeonBossLockedCombatLevel":"Combat Level {{level}}","dungeonTooFar":"Return to the statue to enter the dungeon.","toCraft":" to craft","toUseFurnace":" to use furnace","deathCoinsLost":"Lost {{amount}} [[Gold Coin]] on death"},"notifications":{"title":"Notifications","empty":"Nothing new right now","markAllRead":"Mark all read","dismiss":"Dismiss","dismissAll":"Dismiss all","unreadCount":"Unread: {{count}}","close":"Close","gameInvite":"{{player}} invited you to play {{game}}","untitledGameInvite":"{{player}} invited you to their game","partyInvite":"{{player}} invited you to their party","inviteRowAction":"Click to join"}}'),Yj=JSON.parse('{"shaderPack":{"offInThisGame":"Your shader pack is off in this game.","failedTitle":"Your shader pack couldn\'t run","removePack":"Remove Pack","intro":"Shader packs change how the world looks in games that allow them.","needsWebGpu":"Shader packs need WebGPU, which isn\'t available on this device.","dropHere":"Drop a shader pack folder or .zip here","chooseZipInstructions":"Load a shader pack from a .zip","chooseFolder":"Choose Folder","chooseZip":"Choose .zip","byAuthor":"by {{author}}","statusReady":"Ready to use","statusReadyAfterReload":"Ready. Reload the page to use it.","statusNoWebGpu":"Games that use it won\'t start on this device until you remove it.","statusFailed":"Saved, but it won\'t run until you fix these errors and load it again.","statusFailedRecheck":"Games that use it won\'t start until you fix these errors and load it again, or remove it.","statusChecking":"Checking the pack...","statusUnchecked":"This device couldn\'t check it, so games that use it won\'t start. Reload the page to try again, or remove it.","offInStrict":"Off in strict games. To run the rest of the pack in them, put these inside #ifndef BLOXD_STRICT.","onlyIn":"(only in {{variants}})","moreErrors":"...and {{count}} more","variantStrict":"strict","variantNonStrict":"non-strict","variantLightingOn":"lighting on","variantLightingOff":"lighting off","variantTerrain":"terrain","variantLiquid":"liquid","saveFailed":"Couldn\'t save the pack in this browser.","unexpectedError":"Something went wrong. Please try again.","failedNoWebGpu":"It needs WebGPU, which couldn\'t start on this device.","failedNoLite":"The new WebGPU renderer didn\'t start, so reload the page to try again.","failedRendererOverride":"It needs the new WebGPU renderer, so remove the renderer override from the page address or this browser\'s storage, then reload.","failedToCompile":"It failed to compile in this game: fix it and load it again, or remove it.","failedValidation":"It has errors with this version of Bloxd, listed in the shader pack settings.","loadSplitZip":"Zips split across several files aren\'t supported.","loadTooManyZipEntries":"The zip has more than {{count}} entries.","loadEncrypted":"{{path}} is encrypted. Encrypted zips aren\'t supported.","loadUnsupportedCompression":"{{path}} uses an unsupported zip compression method ({{method}}).","loadNotZip":"Thi